(828691, 93903, 7252, '<td valign="top">The lack of focus is interesting but I think the tip of the whisk needs to be in focus for this to work for me.</td>', 'The lack of focus is interesting but I think the tip of the whisk needs to be in focus for this to work for me.', '2004-07-28 01:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
