(828922, 93080, 6008, '<td valign="top">I cant say I see a web in the bushes every day but I''m sure someone might. The main thing I''m feeling from this is that it has a very harsh and even light where it could have done with a softer light like in the morning or early evening. Getting closer to the web or even spraying it with water (if that was an option) to bring out the details of it would have added more interest.</td>', 'I cant say I see a web in the bushes every day but I''m sure someone might. The main thing I''m feeling from this is that it has a very harsh and even light where it could have done with a softer light like in the morning or early evening. Getting closer to the web or even spraying it with water (if that was an option) to bring out the details of it would have added more interest.', '2004-07-28 01:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(828923, 93191, 19575, '<td valign="top">interesting, but I don''t know what it is.</td>', 'interesting, but I don''t know what it is.', '2004-07-28 01:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
