(828991, 93306, 6008, '<td valign="top">I like the color combo of blue and yellow, they go together well. I also like the negative space on the left - which furthers the starry night theme. The one light being a bright star shape is cute too. The shadows are a little off, but nothing you could do to avoid those and I dont think they distract too much. I like it.</td>', 'I like the color combo of blue and yellow, they go together well. I also like the negative space on the left - which furthers the starry night theme. The one light being a bright star shape is cute too. The shadows are a little off, but nothing you could do to avoid those and I dont think they distract too much. I like it.', '2004-07-28 01:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
