(829340, 93114, 12825, '<td valign="top">Ah, using Windows is a daily bane of my existence, too.  At work, at least.<br/> <br/>Anyway, well done close-up, good use of shallow depth of field.  I like the fact that you either had a clean keyboard to begin with, or took the time to clean it before the shot. ;-)</td>', 'Ah, using Windows is a daily bane of my existence, too.  At work, at least. Anyway, well done close-up, good use of shallow depth of field.  I like the fact that you either had a clean keyboard to begin with, or took the time to clean it before the shot. ;-)', '2004-07-28 08:31:56.000000', NULL, 1),
