(829343, 93206, 22748, '<td valign="top">Positively brilliant!! The colors are stunning and the focus and DOF are perfect. The slight white highlight on the upper right of the jar brings out the texture of the glass before it fades away into the smooth creaminess of the shallow depth of field. I couldn''t give this less than a 10. <br/> <br/>How are the colors done? Is it all in the background, or are there colored lights?</td>', 'Positively brilliant!! The colors are stunning and the focus and DOF are perfect. The slight white highlight on the upper right of the jar brings out the texture of the glass before it fades away into the smooth creaminess of the shallow depth of field. I couldn''t give this less than a 10.  How are the colors done? Is it all in the background, or are there colored lights?', '2004-07-28 08:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
