(829365, 93199, 22748, '<td valign="top">Great primary colors. Interesting composition, with the clothes pins sort of radiating out around the cord, and forming an arc across the image. Slightly out of focus on the closest parts of the yellow and red pins, though. The aperture may have been fine, because even the farthest part of the cord at the top left side is still in focus, so a slightly closer focus point may have improved it.</td>', 'Great primary colors. Interesting composition, with the clothes pins sort of radiating out around the cord, and forming an arc across the image. Slightly out of focus on the closest parts of the yellow and red pins, though. The aperture may have been fine, because even the farthest part of the cord at the top left side is still in focus, so a slightly closer focus point may have improved it.', '2004-07-28 08:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
