(829490, 93422, 20204, '<td valign="top">I like the feel of this image - the sepia like tone works well.  I don''t know if its an optical illusion or not, but the image seems to be very slightly tilted clockwise.  Either way, that didn''t detract from my vote as this was very creative and a nice break from photos of people''s remote controls!</td>', 'I like the feel of this image - the sepia like tone works well.  I don''t know if its an optical illusion or not, but the image seems to be very slightly tilted clockwise.  Either way, that didn''t detract from my vote as this was very creative and a nice break from photos of people''s remote controls!', '2004-07-28 10:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(829492, 93310, 23394, '<td valign="top">i''ve heard these guys playing around at night...good job getting your image to tell a story.</td>', 'i''ve heard these guys playing around at night...good job getting your image to tell a story.', '2004-07-28 10:04:31.000000', NULL, 1),
