(829697, 94016, 6008, '<td valign="top">Hrm, the image seems a little dark with no definite blacks or whites in the image. The color of the spoon bowl seems a mix of blue and purple and does look a little ''shabby''. I''m not sure if the reflection adds much to the composition. It''s not a horrible shot, it borders on being abstract, it just doesnt have much impact.</td>', 'Hrm, the image seems a little dark with no definite blacks or whites in the image. The color of the spoon bowl seems a mix of blue and purple and does look a little ''shabby''. I''m not sure if the reflection adds much to the composition. It''s not a horrible shot, it borders on being abstract, it just doesnt have much impact.', '2004-07-28 11:32:03.000000', NULL, 1),
