(829718, 94024, 22734, '<td valign="top">Very creative, well composed and well lit.</td>', 'Very creative, well composed and well lit.', '2004-07-28 11:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(829719, 93907, 20018, '<td valign="top">not quite getting this one...why is the rosary in the water (holy water?) and why is it domestic? Interesting and makes you want to know more...technically even if the right side was meant to be blown out with white the lights reflecting off the water is distracting</td>', 'not quite getting this one...why is the rosary in the water (holy water?) and why is it domestic? Interesting and makes you want to know more...technically even if the right side was meant to be blown out with white the lights reflecting off the water is distracting', '2004-07-28 11:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
