(829754, 93562, 6008, '<td valign="top">I think shining is beyond them. Shame you didnt have a pair of black dress shoes to go with the old-looking shine box. That said, perhaps you were going for the out of place type shot. Personal preference, but I probably would have liked to have seen the box in the foreground with its detail and texture and slightly OOF shoes in the background. I think that''s mostly because the shoes dont hold much interest as they have no real interest or appeal or mood. Your shot isnt bad, I just dont think it holds much appeal, mood, or impact as is.</td>', 'I think shining is beyond them. Shame you didnt have a pair of black dress shoes to go with the old-looking shine box. That said, perhaps you were going for the out of place type shot. Personal preference, but I probably would have liked to have seen the box in the foreground with its detail and texture and slightly OOF shoes in the background. I think that''s mostly because the shoes dont hold much interest as they have no real interest or appeal or mood. Your shot isnt bad, I just dont think it holds much appeal, mood, or impact as is.', '2004-07-28 11:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(829755, 93779, 23312, '<td valign="top">I wish the blades were brighter - I realize that you could very well have them dark intentionally, but I find a bright polished steel blade more sinister.  Better light might also put more attention on the blood.</td>', 'I wish the blades were brighter - I realize that you could very well have them dark intentionally, but I find a bright polished steel blade more sinister.  Better light might also put more attention on the blood.', '2004-07-28 11:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
