(830073, 92834, 15919, '<td valign="top">Very cool lightning experiment.  What´s the background?  Maybe your computerscreen.</td>', 'Very cool lightning experiment.  What´s the background?  Maybe your computerscreen.', '2004-07-28 14:29:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(830075, 93837, 23454, '<td valign="top">Definitely and interesting capture! Beautiful sky, and I like how you can see it through so much of the glass in the church. The building looks as if it needs to be lightened a bit to bring out more detail. The image has a slight tilt to it, needs to be rotated counterclockwise just a degree or two. [8]</td>', 'Definitely and interesting capture! Beautiful sky, and I like how you can see it through so much of the glass in the church. The building looks as if it needs to be lightened a bit to bring out more detail. The image has a slight tilt to it, needs to be rotated counterclockwise just a degree or two. [8]', '2004-07-28 14:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(830076, 93849, 15919, '<td valign="top">Nice experiment and interesting shot.  Think though that it could have been better performed.</td>', 'Nice experiment and interesting shot.  Think though that it could have been better performed.', '2004-07-28 14:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(830081, 94073, 23454, '<td valign="top">Is this an egg yolk or something? Without the title I wouldn''t have known what to even guess it was. The image appears to be over sharpened. The dark shadow and larger border are very harsh.</td>', 'Is this an egg yolk or something? Without the title I wouldn''t have known what to even guess it was. The image appears to be over sharpened. The dark shadow and larger border are very harsh.', '2004-07-28 14:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(830083, 93773, 23454, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! I love the lighting, focus and colors of this photo! Very nice capture! [9]</td>', 'Beautiful! I love the lighting, focus and colors of this photo! Very nice capture! [9]', '2004-07-28 14:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(830089, 93998, 23454, '<td valign="top">Nice clean capture. The focus and lighting look great. I like the bright background color to give it some punch. [8]</td>', 'Nice clean capture. The focus and lighting look great. I like the bright background color to give it some punch. [8]', '2004-07-28 14:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(830093, 93249, 22392, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, but this is really not such a good picture of a dog. Out of focus and the b&amp;w doesn''t add to it. the red eyes give it a very amateuristic look.</td>', 'I''m sorry, but this is really not such a good picture of a dog. Out of focus and the b&w doesn''t add to it. the red eyes give it a very amateuristic look.', '2004-07-28 14:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(830094, 93233, 10593, '<td valign="top">this is a nice peaceful picture.  just the way the grass and trees are it kind of looks fake.  i give it an 8</td>', 'this is a nice peaceful picture.  just the way the grass and trees are it kind of looks fake.  i give it an 8', '2004-07-28 14:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(830096, 94103, 10593, '<td valign="top">good composition :)</td>', 'good composition :)', '2004-07-28 14:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(830098, 94084, 10593, '<td valign="top">not something i see everyday, but its beautiful :)</td>', 'not something i see everyday, but its beautiful :)', '2004-07-28 14:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(830100, 93219, 23454, '<td valign="top">That is a gorgeous pen. I think if you had used it in a more interesting setting...writing a letter in calligraphy or something it would have made a much better impact. It seems out of place here for something so ornate. The lighting and focus of the pen is great - and I know how hard it is to focus properly on reflective objects! The composition just needs a little work.  [6]</td>', 'That is a gorgeous pen. I think if you had used it in a more interesting setting...writing a letter in calligraphy or something it would have made a much better impact. It seems out of place here for something so ornate. The lighting and focus of the pen is great - and I know how hard it is to focus properly on reflective objects! The composition just needs a little work.  [6]', '2004-07-28 14:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(830102, 93431, 10593, '<td valign="top">nice lighting</td>', 'nice lighting', '2004-07-28 14:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(830104, 93503, 10593, '<td valign="top">cool!</td>', 'cool!', '2004-07-28 14:46:12.000000', NULL, 1);
