(830212, 93687, 22922, '<td valign="top">Very grainy and appears oversharpened.  The idea is good, but try a lower ISO to get rid of the grain and capture the dawnlight.</td>', 'Very grainy and appears oversharpened.  The idea is good, but try a lower ISO to get rid of the grain and capture the dawnlight.', '2004-07-28 15:32:18.000000', NULL, 1),
