(830215, 93170, 22922, '<td valign="top">Something needs to be in focus.  I like your idea, but you need to give the image a focal point, generally by bringing a part of the image into focus.</td>', 'Something needs to be in focus.  I like your idea, but you need to give the image a focal point, generally by bringing a part of the image into focus.', '2004-07-28 15:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
