(830230, 94078, 22922, '<td valign="top">A very nice idea, I like the bottom 1/3 with the folds of cheese, but the top half is blown out from the light off the metal.  We also see a reflection of skin tone on the bottom left.  Try softer light, and maybe a longer exposure to get rid of the reflections.  Or just crop the top 2/3 of the picture out, the bottom of the image is so sharp.</td>', 'A very nice idea, I like the bottom 1/3 with the folds of cheese, but the top half is blown out from the light off the metal.  We also see a reflection of skin tone on the bottom left.  Try softer light, and maybe a longer exposure to get rid of the reflections.  Or just crop the top 2/3 of the picture out, the bottom of the image is so sharp.', '2004-07-28 15:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(830232, 93308, 22734, '<td valign="top">Hey, what did you put in there, cold ice? Very nice comp and lighting.</td>', 'Hey, what did you put in there, cold ice? Very nice comp and lighting.', '2004-07-28 15:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(830233, 93096, 22922, '<td valign="top">Cute, nice candid (or setup candid) and very humorous.  Good color and sharpness, DOF is perfect.  Glad you only show the torso, great shot.</td>', 'Cute, nice candid (or setup candid) and very humorous.  Good color and sharpness, DOF is perfect.  Glad you only show the torso, great shot.', '2004-07-28 15:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
