(830293, 92899, 23394, '<td valign="top">seems to be oversharpened.  if the horse is you object of focus, you might want to narrow your dof so that the background won''t be a distraction.</td>', 'seems to be oversharpened.  if the horse is you object of focus, you might want to narrow your dof so that the background won''t be a distraction.', '2004-07-28 16:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
