(830308, 93118, 23394, '<td valign="top">oh, this begs for you to be a little closer with a little less light and with a little more focus.  if your camera can''t do it, try backing off with a different angle, then cropping in to produce your final image.</td>', 'oh, this begs for you to be a little closer with a little less light and with a little more focus.  if your camera can''t do it, try backing off with a different angle, then cropping in to produce your final image.', '2004-07-28 16:36:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(830310, 94106, 19959, '<td valign="top">That is an interesting composition. Nice work!</td>', 'That is an interesting composition. Nice work!', '2004-07-28 16:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(830311, 93682, 23394, '<td valign="top">great shot!  very well balanced.  pretty strong lenses, btw...<br/></td>', 'great shot!  very well balanced.  pretty strong lenses, btw...', '2004-07-28 16:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(830313, 92768, 19959, '<td valign="top">interesting composition. Good DOF. Well done</td>', 'interesting composition. Good DOF. Well done', '2004-07-28 16:37:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(830315, 93865, 19751, '<td valign="top">too compressed</td>', 'too compressed', '2004-07-28 16:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(830316, 93206, 19959, '<td valign="top">Great color. Good work!</td>', 'Great color. Good work!', '2004-07-28 16:41:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(830318, 93788, 23394, '<td valign="top">you get points for meeting the challenge, but not too many for execution.  this is a place where ''less is more''.  for me, there is too much stuff in the picture; probably could lose the cell phone without hurting the image.  also, the lighting is a little uneven across the keys.  cropping out half of them doesn''t help; maybe a set of keys with fewer keys?  all the same, great focus, nice dof.</td>', 'you get points for meeting the challenge, but not too many for execution.  this is a place where ''less is more''.  for me, there is too much stuff in the picture; probably could lose the cell phone without hurting the image.  also, the lighting is a little uneven across the keys.  cropping out half of them doesn''t help; maybe a set of keys with fewer keys?  all the same, great focus, nice dof.', '2004-07-28 16:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
