(830402, 93571, 22748, '<td valign="top">Very cool! I love the colors of the flowers, and the rainbows projected onto the tabletop in their shadow. But a bit tighter crop might be better, and it kind of feels unbalanced with the light only illuminating one side. Also, the brightest spot in the image is at the center of the top edge, drawing the eye away from the main subject. But a beautiful shot nonetheless.</td>', 'Very cool! I love the colors of the flowers, and the rainbows projected onto the tabletop in their shadow. But a bit tighter crop might be better, and it kind of feels unbalanced with the light only illuminating one side. Also, the brightest spot in the image is at the center of the top edge, drawing the eye away from the main subject. But a beautiful shot nonetheless.', '2004-07-28 17:20:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(830403, 93422, 22011, '<td valign="top">Zoom blur?  Neat effect..  As an abstract this is really neat, although for the challenge I''m not quite sure what the objects are.  The important thing is that it made be stop and look.  Well done.</td>', 'Zoom blur?  Neat effect..  As an abstract this is really neat, although for the challenge I''m not quite sure what the objects are.  The important thing is that it made be stop and look.  Well done.', '2004-07-28 17:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
