(830422, 93952, 23394, '<td valign="top">good idea, but unfortuntely, the execution could use a little tuning.  overall, it''s a little busy; probably could lose the other stuff on the table.  also, the flash is a little strong; you might want to try it with something to minimize the flash.  from a composition standpoint, you might try moving everything in closer to the tv so there is nothing but the tv and the remotes in the picture.  you''ve made a good start; the key is to build on it.</td>', 'good idea, but unfortuntely, the execution could use a little tuning.  overall, it''s a little busy; probably could lose the other stuff on the table.  also, the flash is a little strong; you might want to try it with something to minimize the flash.  from a composition standpoint, you might try moving everything in closer to the tv so there is nothing but the tv and the remotes in the picture.  you''ve made a good start; the key is to build on it.', '2004-07-28 17:30:11.000000', NULL, 1),
