(830440, 93564, 23394, '<td valign="top">ok, i understand what you''re shooting at, and i would like to score it higher, but for two things:  1) it is small (it should be at least 640 pixels on the longest side), and 2) because of #1, i can''t really see enough of the detail to tell if its in focus or to appreciate the coloring.</td>', 'ok, i understand what you''re shooting at, and i would like to score it higher, but for two things:  1) it is small (it should be at least 640 pixels on the longest side), and 2) because of #1, i can''t really see enough of the detail to tell if its in focus or to appreciate the coloring.', '2004-07-28 17:38:44.000000', NULL, 1),
