(830485, 93456, 23394, '<td valign="top">i love the idea, but am not sure what it is about the picture that doesn''t pop for me.  it probably has to do with the lighting, the lack of sharpness, and that this is the best you can do under the constraints of basic editing.  would love to see the original.</td>', 'i love the idea, but am not sure what it is about the picture that doesn''t pop for me.  it probably has to do with the lighting, the lack of sharpness, and that this is the best you can do under the constraints of basic editing.  would love to see the original.', '2004-07-28 18:02:25.000000', NULL, 1),
