(830522, 93206, 19608, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of the blue-yellow theme and very nice lighting setup too.  Too bad it is a basic editing challenge - it could be cleaned up in spots.  Even so - a great entry - thanks for sharing.  I expect you will be in the top few.</td>', 'Excellent use of the blue-yellow theme and very nice lighting setup too.  Too bad it is a basic editing challenge - it could be cleaned up in spots.  Even so - a great entry - thanks for sharing.  I expect you will be in the top few.', '2004-07-28 18:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
