(830836, 94033, 22392, '<td valign="top">something''s gone wrong here with either your resolution, sharpening or compression, but it doesn''t look right. The colors could be much more lively and there is not much detail. I like the "fluffy" feeling on the leaves.</td>', 'something''s gone wrong here with either your resolution, sharpening or compression, but it doesn''t look right. The colors could be much more lively and there is not much detail. I like the "fluffy" feeling on the leaves.', '2004-07-28 21:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
