(830840, 93206, 22392, '<td valign="top">i haven''t got a clue what it is. (wait... the top of a jar, right?). I was gonna say but I love it anyway because of the colors. So 8 from me, with or without recognition.</td>', 'i haven''t got a clue what it is. (wait... the top of a jar, right?). I was gonna say but I love it anyway because of the colors. So 8 from me, with or without recognition.', '2004-07-28 21:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
