(830884, 93859, 23394, '<td valign="top">this is an interesting shot, but i''m having a hard time stretching it to ''everyday objects''.  on the other hand, it''s a welcome break from pictures of remotes and keychains (no offense to any of those photographers intended--there were some really great images of remotes and keychains).  heck, i''m feeling generous, i''ll score this a</td>', 'this is an interesting shot, but i''m having a hard time stretching it to ''everyday objects''.  on the other hand, it''s a welcome break from pictures of remotes and keychains (no offense to any of those photographers intended--there were some really great images of remotes and keychains).  heck, i''m feeling generous, i''ll score this a', '2004-07-28 22:06:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(830886, 93483, 17279, '<td valign="top">Yep, I see these all the time!</td>', 'Yep, I see these all the time!', '2004-07-28 22:06:34.000000', NULL, 1),
