(830929, 93685, 23394, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot!  great contrast, colors, lighting, focus.  however, you do need to clean your sensor (see that black spot at the top just left of center).  they only come out under slow shudder speeds or tight f-stops.  (now, let me go out on a limb:  you''re shooting a rebel 300 and you change lenses frequently...)  anyways, great job shooting, hope you place well.</td>', 'beautiful shot!  great contrast, colors, lighting, focus.  however, you do need to clean your sensor (see that black spot at the top just left of center).  they only come out under slow shudder speeds or tight f-stops.  (now, let me go out on a limb:  you''re shooting a rebel 300 and you change lenses frequently...)  anyways, great job shooting, hope you place well.', '2004-07-28 22:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
