(831834, 93216, 24512, '<td valign="top">very eye-catching composition.  it sseems a little overexposed - no pun intended.  The color is a little "washed out" - pun intended.</td>', 'very eye-catching composition.  it sseems a little overexposed - no pun intended.  The color is a little "washed out" - pun intended.', '2004-07-29 10:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(831835, 94016, 19425, '<td valign="top">what the heck? looks like you took a picture and then added a blue color cast to it...i would have liked to seen alittle more sharpness...sorry</td>', 'what the heck? looks like you took a picture and then added a blue color cast to it...i would have liked to seen alittle more sharpness...sorry', '2004-07-29 10:47:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(831836, 94116, 24512, '<td valign="top">Nice color choice</td>', 'Nice color choice', '2004-07-29 10:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(831837, 93961, 19425, '<td valign="top">pic is very washed out...some more contrast would have made a bunch of difference..</td>', 'pic is very washed out...some more contrast would have made a bunch of difference..', '2004-07-29 10:48:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(831838, 93688, 19425, '<td valign="top">too washed out for my taste...and clean that car!!..heh</td>', 'too washed out for my taste...and clean that car!!..heh', '2004-07-29 10:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(831839, 92879, 19425, '<td valign="top">i imagine some of our younger voters will have no idea what this is....<br/>cool picture!</td>', 'i imagine some of our younger voters will have no idea what this is....cool picture!', '2004-07-29 10:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(831841, 92834, 20941, '<td valign="top">ahhhh...now THIS is what I interpret this challenge to be all about. You took an everyday object artistically composed it to make it look interesting and technically executed it to perfection! Great Job...10</td>', 'ahhhh...now THIS is what I interpret this challenge to be all about. You took an everyday object artistically composed it to make it look interesting and technically executed it to perfection! Great Job...10', '2004-07-29 10:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(831881, 93952, 1922, '<td valign="top">Looks like my house. Good DOF and nice lighting.</td>', 'Looks like my house. Good DOF and nice lighting.', '2004-07-29 12:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(831899, 94106, 11467, '<td valign="top">Oooo Ouch! I''m glad that picture''s not on my wall.<br/>Photo is well executed, but ot realy my cup of tea!! 6</td>', 'Oooo Ouch! I''m glad that picture''s not on my wall.Photo is well executed, but ot realy my cup of tea!! 6', '2004-07-29 12:14:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(831901, 93992, 11467, '<td valign="top">Took me a while to notice the humming bird. <br/>A plain background would help bring this into the foreground.</td>', 'Took me a while to notice the humming bird. A plain background would help bring this into the foreground.', '2004-07-29 12:17:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(831902, 93857, 11467, '<td valign="top">Is that an egg nogg ;-)<br/>Nice composition. 7</td>', 'Is that an egg nogg ;-)Nice composition. 7', '2004-07-29 12:18:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(831907, 93469, 14603, '<td valign="top">Nice high key image which helps to give an ordinary subject a special feel.<br/>Hope you`re not getting hammered for "overexposure".<br/>Nice composition as well....good work</td>', 'Nice high key image which helps to give an ordinary subject a special feel.Hope you`re not getting hammered for "overexposure".Nice composition as well....good work', '2004-07-29 12:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(831911, 93860, 11467, '<td valign="top">Ha ha ha!<br/>Like the humor (Extra point)<br/>Composition is a bit plain &amp; uninteresting. I think you could have made more of the idea. Perhaps the island is not over convincing as an Island.</td>', 'Ha ha ha!Like the humor (Extra point)Composition is a bit plain & uninteresting. I think you could have made more of the idea. Perhaps the island is not over convincing as an Island.', '2004-07-29 12:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(831912, 93933, 14603, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed and well lit.<br/>Might not be as "everyday" as some other objects...certainly not in my neck of the woods but good image overall....8</td>', 'Nicely composed and well lit.Might not be as "everyday" as some other objects...certainly not in my neck of the woods but good image overall....8', '2004-07-29 12:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(831914, 93809, 11467, '<td valign="top">Image is nice, but looses impact as it is so small. You can have up to 640 pixels width/height. Use it.</td>', 'Image is nice, but looses impact as it is so small. You can have up to 640 pixels width/height. Use it.', '2004-07-29 12:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(831917, 93979, 14603, '<td valign="top">This image has a nice feel to it, I like the lighting which shows up the texture on the diary very well.I also like how you`ve composed it with the words in the middle of the image but at an angle to give it that little bit of interest.The focus seems a little soft on the pen, but that aside it`s an excellent piece of work.</td>', 'This image has a nice feel to it, I like the lighting which shows up the texture on the diary very well.I also like how you`ve composed it with the words in the middle of the image but at an angle to give it that little bit of interest.The focus seems a little soft on the pen, but that aside it`s an excellent piece of work.', '2004-07-29 12:36:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(831919, 94058, 11467, '<td valign="top">A lower perspective would make this more interesting. Look for alternative angles, from the floor looking up perhaps.<br/>Focus, colour are fine, just needs to be made more interesting in some way.</td>', 'A lower perspective would make this more interesting. Look for alternative angles, from the floor looking up perhaps.Focus, colour are fine, just needs to be made more interesting in some way.', '2004-07-29 12:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(831921, 93767, 14603, '<td valign="top">A subject which has been done quite often but you have managed to add something special to this.<br/>Good lighting and exposure added to the composition.. which works well given how busy the image is..makes this one of the top shots so far for me.</td>', 'A subject which has been done quite often but you have managed to add something special to this.Good lighting and exposure added to the composition.. which works well given how busy the image is..makes this one of the top shots so far for me.', '2004-07-29 12:41:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(831927, 94089, 20613, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot, and it made me laugh :)</td>', 'This is a great shot, and it made me laugh :)', '2004-07-29 12:54:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(831928, 93729, 20613, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  I love the Domino''s Pizza logo in the background :) 8!</td>', 'Great shot!  I love the Domino''s Pizza logo in the background :) 8!', '2004-07-29 12:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(831932, 93411, 17357, '<td valign="top">not too crazy about the border</td>', 'not too crazy about the border', '2004-07-29 13:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(831940, 94026, 17357, '<td valign="top">maybe used a little longer exposure? 6</td>', 'maybe used a little longer exposure? 6', '2004-07-29 13:10:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(831950, 92976, 2612, '<td valign="top">I think this could have been a little softer (no pun intended). This lighting is a little harsh which really isn''t complementary to the subject. I''m not sure what type of lighting was used, but a diffuser of some type might have helped out.</td>', 'I think this could have been a little softer (no pun intended). This lighting is a little harsh which really isn''t complementary to the subject. I''m not sure what type of lighting was used, but a diffuser of some type might have helped out.', '2004-07-29 13:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(831951, 93749, 21724, '<td valign="top">absolutely gorgeous.. The lighting is wonderful, it adds a very surreal touch to this.. I have high hopes for this picture!!</td>', 'absolutely gorgeous.. The lighting is wonderful, it adds a very surreal touch to this.. I have high hopes for this picture!!', '2004-07-29 13:32:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(831952, 94095, 21724, '<td valign="top">fantastic, great use of DOF!  I predict top 10 for this one..</td>', 'fantastic, great use of DOF!  I predict top 10 for this one..', '2004-07-29 13:33:18.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(831953, 93791, 21724, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract.. May be a little TOO abstract to win here, but it''s a fantastic photo regardless!</td>', 'Nice abstract.. May be a little TOO abstract to win here, but it''s a fantastic photo regardless!', '2004-07-29 13:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(831955, 92741, 2612, '<td valign="top">An interesting shot. I am somewhat bothered by the fact that the pen is slightly out of focus. I could understand out of focus to shift attention to eyes or in focus as one of the objects, but it seems to be somewhere in between.</td>', 'An interesting shot. I am somewhat bothered by the fact that the pen is slightly out of focus. I could understand out of focus to shift attention to eyes or in focus as one of the objects, but it seems to be somewhere in between.', '2004-07-29 13:35:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(831956, 94108, 21724, '<td valign="top">I have to wonder why you decided to make this so pixelated.. I would have much preferred a nice, sharp photo. Great idea, though</td>', 'I have to wonder why you decided to make this so pixelated.. I would have much preferred a nice, sharp photo. Great idea, though', '2004-07-29 13:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(831958, 93660, 21724, '<td valign="top">i have tried and tried and tried to get a panning shot like this, and I just can''t do it.  This is a great one, fantastic job</td>', 'i have tried and tried and tried to get a panning shot like this, and I just can''t do it.  This is a great one, fantastic job', '2004-07-29 13:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(831960, 93604, 21724, '<td valign="top">great photo, you should definitely have a print available for this one!!!</td>', 'great photo, you should definitely have a print available for this one!!!', '2004-07-29 13:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(831962, 93469, 21724, '<td valign="top">those little dirt specks are really distracting, but I guess there''s not much you can do about it in Basic Editing.. nice shot, would make a great stock photo, i think</td>', 'those little dirt specks are really distracting, but I guess there''s not much you can do about it in Basic Editing.. nice shot, would make a great stock photo, i think', '2004-07-29 13:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(831964, 93161, 21724, '<td valign="top">GREAT shot, love the lighting on this one!!! the dark background and deep shadows really give this photograph an edge that must bug macros don''t have.  love it!</td>', 'GREAT shot, love the lighting on this one!!! the dark background and deep shadows really give this photograph an edge that must bug macros don''t have.  love it!', '2004-07-29 13:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(831966, 93837, 21724, '<td valign="top">it is interesting, but is it really an everyday object?  hmm...</td>', 'it is interesting, but is it really an everyday object?  hmm...', '2004-07-29 13:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(831967, 93973, 21724, '<td valign="top">nice use of sepia, I really like the feel that it gives to this shot</td>', 'nice use of sepia, I really like the feel that it gives to this shot', '2004-07-29 13:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(831970, 93715, 21724, '<td valign="top">cool composition, this is a really clever idea.. I wish the background were more white than blue... After the challenge is over, I would suggest trying to tone down all the blue in this photo and make it a more cleaner, purer white, and this would a fantastic stock photo</td>', 'cool composition, this is a really clever idea.. I wish the background were more white than blue... After the challenge is over, I would suggest trying to tone down all the blue in this photo and make it a more cleaner, purer white, and this would a fantastic stock photo', '2004-07-29 13:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(831971, 93430, 21724, '<td valign="top">great idea, this is really nice, but the lighting on the frame seems too harsh in the lower right corner and too dark in the upper left corner..  it makes the frame seem a little too fake against the elegance of the sunset behind it</td>', 'great idea, this is really nice, but the lighting on the frame seems too harsh in the lower right corner and too dark in the upper left corner..  it makes the frame seem a little too fake against the elegance of the sunset behind it', '2004-07-29 13:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(831972, 93198, 2612, '<td valign="top">This could have been a lot of fun, but the "objects" need more light. Fill flash or some light from a reflector would have brightened them up against that blue sky.</td>', 'This could have been a lot of fun, but the "objects" need more light. Fill flash or some light from a reflector would have brightened them up against that blue sky.', '2004-07-29 13:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(831973, 93399, 21724, '<td valign="top">focus needs a little bit of work, everything here is blurry.. try to avoid putting things in the dead center of the photo - use the rule of thirds, or at least take it from a more interesting angle.  the background needs to go, too.. stick with solid colors, so they don''t detract from your focal point</td>', 'focus needs a little bit of work, everything here is blurry.. try to avoid putting things in the dead center of the photo - use the rule of thirds, or at least take it from a more interesting angle.  the background needs to go, too.. stick with solid colors, so they don''t detract from your focal point', '2004-07-29 13:46:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(831975, 94111, 21724, '<td valign="top">the faucet seems off center to me, and it''s kind of throwing off my perception.. nice clean lines, but the dirt streaks in the upper left corner and really distracting.. good shot :)</td>', 'the faucet seems off center to me, and it''s kind of throwing off my perception.. nice clean lines, but the dirt streaks in the upper left corner and really distracting.. good shot :)', '2004-07-29 13:47:51.000000', NULL, 1),
