(831994, 93769, 24500, '<td valign="top">without history, we would never know where we come from or where we are going.  Nice black and white image of a black and white subject.  Celine thinks these are wipes and the peanut butter sandwich she had to clean this morning.  Mike thinks its toilet paper he used this morning and probably tonight.  I believe the past unrolls and you get a clearer picture of what just happened (tube uncovered) leaving us to make better choices now and for the future.</td>', 'without history, we would never know where we come from or where we are going.  Nice black and white image of a black and white subject.  Celine thinks these are wipes and the peanut butter sandwich she had to clean this morning.  Mike thinks its toilet paper he used this morning and probably tonight.  I believe the past unrolls and you get a clearer picture of what just happened (tube uncovered) leaving us to make better choices now and for the future.', '2004-07-29 14:11:30.000000', NULL, 1),
