(832320, 94020, 22748, '<td valign="top">The pic is really small, it would be much better at a bit larger size. However, the color and DOF are great. Nice lines provided by the toothbrushes, but the far end of the handles are a bit close to the edge of the frame with the yellow one seeming to touch it, which sort of throws off the balance to my eye.</td>', 'The pic is really small, it would be much better at a bit larger size. However, the color and DOF are great. Nice lines provided by the toothbrushes, but the far end of the handles are a bit close to the edge of the frame with the yellow one seeming to touch it, which sort of throws off the balance to my eye.', '2004-07-29 17:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(832350, 94078, 11895, '<td valign="top">very nice pic but would have scored higher with me if there were greater depth of field, would like to see all of it in focus</td>', 'very nice pic but would have scored higher with me if there were greater depth of field, would like to see all of it in focus', '2004-07-29 17:47:03.000000', NULL, 1),
