(832439, 93216, 19978, '<td valign="top">Very nice: simple, excellent use of color, but most of all, and the reason I voted high, wonderful use of negative space. Well done!</td>', 'Very nice: simple, excellent use of color, but most of all, and the reason I voted high, wonderful use of negative space. Well done!', '2004-07-29 18:40:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(832523, 92822, 772, '<td valign="top">There is much beauty in simplicity.  I like this image quite a bit.  The negative space at the bottom is something I can''t really determine how much I like.  I can''t seem to put a value on its purpose other than balancing the composition to a centered view across the horizontal.  The image seems to wlrk well with that part cut out also.  Either way, I like it.... very nice work :)</td>', 'There is much beauty in simplicity.  I like this image quite a bit.  The negative space at the bottom is something I can''t really determine how much I like.  I can''t seem to put a value on its purpose other than balancing the composition to a centered view across the horizontal.  The image seems to wlrk well with that part cut out also.  Either way, I like it.... very nice work :)', '2004-07-29 19:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(832528, 92979, 16493, '<td valign="top">Looked at this picture now for the 3ed time - gave it first 5 but is up to 7 now and I think that is where it will end up.</td>', 'Looked at this picture now for the 3ed time - gave it first 5 but is up to 7 now and I think that is where it will end up.', '2004-07-29 19:47:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(832532, 93604, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely composition.  It reminds me almost exactly of a spot I pulled off the road on the Blue Ridge Parkway about a week ago as I was riding to Asheville, NC.  I like the leading like created by the wall that takes me to the tree and back to the course of travel.  The fog is beautiful.  I love the way it interacts with landscapes in photography.<br/> <br/>The sepia tone here bothers me slightly.  In some way, it counters the effect of the fog.  In general, when I think of fog, I think of cooler temperatures.  The added warmth in the image with the sepia tone contradicts this feeling somewhat.   If this was one of my own photos, I would have chosen the black and white route most likely and maybe added a very slight tint of blue to enhance the feeling of ''coolness'' in this beautiful scene.  <br/> <br/>Beautiful photo :)</td>', 'This is a lovely composition.  It reminds me almost exactly of a spot I pulled off the road on the Blue Ridge Parkway about a week ago as I was riding to Asheville, NC.  I like the leading like created by the wall that takes me to the tree and back to the course of travel.  The fog is beautiful.  I love the way it interacts with landscapes in photography. The sepia tone here bothers me slightly.  In some way, it counters the effect of the fog.  In general, when I think of fog, I think of cooler temperatures.  The added warmth in the image with the sepia tone contradicts this feeling somewhat.   If this was one of my own photos, I would have chosen the black and white route most likely and maybe added a very slight tint of blue to enhance the feeling of ''coolness'' in this beautiful scene.   Beautiful photo :)', '2004-07-29 19:51:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(832539, 93882, 772, '<td valign="top">This is one of the strongest action captures I have seen in a long time.  You have captured intensity and ''personality'' with this dog.  These aspects go a very long way in separating simple pet snapshots from a great photograph.  Kudos on an excellent shot = 10.</td>', 'This is one of the strongest action captures I have seen in a long time.  You have captured intensity and ''personality'' with this dog.  These aspects go a very long way in separating simple pet snapshots from a great photograph.  Kudos on an excellent shot = 10.', '2004-07-29 19:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
