(832674, 92951, 12857, '<td valign="top">I like what you are trying to do here.  The concept is a great.  I know this would be a hard photo to take.  Such bright light really making overexposure a nightmare to deal with.  The cello is exposed properly but it is blurry.  I would also loose the shadow on the right hand side and clean up the vignetting on the top.  I might have taken it against a flat background rather than a corner so that if the entire background was overexposed it would just appear white. In this case the molding is exposed correctly and thus makes it distracting.  Hope this helps.  <br/>dc</td>', 'I like what you are trying to do here.  The concept is a great.  I know this would be a hard photo to take.  Such bright light really making overexposure a nightmare to deal with.  The cello is exposed properly but it is blurry.  I would also loose the shadow on the right hand side and clean up the vignetting on the top.  I might have taken it against a flat background rather than a corner so that if the entire background was overexposed it would just appear white. In this case the molding is exposed correctly and thus makes it distracting.  Hope this helps.  dc', '2004-07-29 21:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
