(832678, 94083, 12857, '<td valign="top">At first I hated this photo.  But I always go back at least 2-3 times and really look at the photo.  The more I look the more I like.   At first it was distracting.  Now I think it is really surreal and quite disturbing in an Alice and Wonderland sort of way.  I guess what I am trying to say is I really like it.  Good job. <br/>dc<br/></td>', 'At first I hated this photo.  But I always go back at least 2-3 times and really look at the photo.  The more I look the more I like.   At first it was distracting.  Now I think it is really surreal and quite disturbing in an Alice and Wonderland sort of way.  I guess what I am trying to say is I really like it.  Good job. dc', '2004-07-29 21:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
