(832972, 93627, 22748, '<td valign="top">Fabulous photo. Perfect focus, the eyes are nice and sharp. Cute pose. Nice shallow DOF. Unfortunately, I don''t count people or animals as objects. So to me, as great as the photo is, it doesn''t meet the challenge of "Everyday Objects". (Maybe if the title were "Andy the Acorn gets eaten", then the squirrel wouldn''t be the subject and thereby the ''object'', but by the title, I assume your subject is the squirrel.)</td>', 'Fabulous photo. Perfect focus, the eyes are nice and sharp. Cute pose. Nice shallow DOF. Unfortunately, I don''t count people or animals as objects. So to me, as great as the photo is, it doesn''t meet the challenge of "Everyday Objects". (Maybe if the title were "Andy the Acorn gets eaten", then the squirrel wouldn''t be the subject and thereby the ''object'', but by the title, I assume your subject is the squirrel.)', '2004-07-30 04:47:56.000000', NULL, 1),
