(833122, 93105, 20204, '<td valign="top">Yikes!  This looks like it was maybe taken with a phone cam or something.  Major pixelization, and focus problems.  The corner is also very distracting.</td>', 'Yikes!  This looks like it was maybe taken with a phone cam or something.  Major pixelization, and focus problems.  The corner is also very distracting.', '2004-07-30 08:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(833124, 93308, 20204, '<td valign="top">I like the coposition, except that it''s a bit too dark in the background.  The black mug coupled with a dark background (to me) has the effect of not allowing the subject (the mug) to stand out.  I love how the steam is captured though - very cool.</td>', 'I like the coposition, except that it''s a bit too dark in the background.  The black mug coupled with a dark background (to me) has the effect of not allowing the subject (the mug) to stand out.  I love how the steam is captured though - very cool.', '2004-07-30 08:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(833125, 92819, 20204, '<td valign="top">This image is technically good, and the background is excellent...  Just not a very interesting subject.</td>', 'This image is technically good, and the background is excellent...  Just not a very interesting subject.', '2004-07-30 09:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(833126, 93967, 20204, '<td valign="top">Wow, you live in a junkyard?  Stretching the everyday theme a bit...  B/W was a good choice for this image.</td>', 'Wow, you live in a junkyard?  Stretching the everyday theme a bit...  B/W was a good choice for this image.', '2004-07-30 09:01:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(833127, 94007, 24846, '<td valign="top">Although I don''t see a gazing ball along the shore everyday, I like the shot.</td>', 'Although I don''t see a gazing ball along the shore everyday, I like the shot.', '2004-07-30 09:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(833129, 94063, 20204, '<td valign="top">I love the use of background and sepia toning in this image.  Works very well.  I wouldn''t have gone with the border, but that''s just me.</td>', 'I love the use of background and sepia toning in this image.  Works very well.  I wouldn''t have gone with the border, but that''s just me.', '2004-07-30 09:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(833131, 93980, 20204, '<td valign="top">Great choice of shutter speed, and I like the cropping as well.</td>', 'Great choice of shutter speed, and I like the cropping as well.', '2004-07-30 09:05:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(833132, 94078, 20204, '<td valign="top">Cool idea, but needs more depth of field to keep the whole thing in focus.  Also need more ambient (vs. direct) light to avoid the highlights at the top of the image.</td>', 'Cool idea, but needs more depth of field to keep the whole thing in focus.  Also need more ambient (vs. direct) light to avoid the highlights at the top of the image.', '2004-07-30 09:06:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(833133, 93066, 20407, '<td valign="top">While it is an everyday object it is quite dark. I think it would help if you were to zoom in more on the watch, the stuff around the edges isn''t as interesting.</td>', 'While it is an everyday object it is quite dark. I think it would help if you were to zoom in more on the watch, the stuff around the edges isn''t as interesting.', '2004-07-30 09:06:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(833135, 92912, 20204, '<td valign="top">I''m not crazy about the tiny subject and the dominating radial effect...  I like to see a stronger subject.  the other plant in the image is distracting as well.</td>', 'I''m not crazy about the tiny subject and the dominating radial effect...  I like to see a stronger subject.  the other plant in the image is distracting as well.', '2004-07-30 09:07:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(833137, 93543, 20407, '<td valign="top">The shot is well balanced. You can''t actually see the globe itself - I think it would help if you could see it.</td>', 'The shot is well balanced. You can''t actually see the globe itself - I think it would help if you could see it.', '2004-07-30 09:07:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(833138, 93399, 20407, '<td valign="top">The background is a little distracting. It would help you to adjust the colour levels so that black is really black - you''ll find it makes all the difference.</td>', 'The background is a little distracting. It would help you to adjust the colour levels so that black is really black - you''ll find it makes all the difference.', '2004-07-30 09:08:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(833139, 93866, 20204, '<td valign="top">I don''t think any part of the subject is in focus...</td>', 'I don''t think any part of the subject is in focus...', '2004-07-30 09:08:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(833140, 93006, 20407, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting perspective. It would help the image if the powerpoint and plug were in a little more focus.</td>', 'This is an interesting perspective. It would help the image if the powerpoint and plug were in a little more focus.', '2004-07-30 09:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(833141, 93769, 23251, '<td valign="top">Very smart!</td>', 'Very smart!', '2004-07-30 09:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(833142, 93709, 20204, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, but a bit too much lighting.  I''d like to see a more even tone on the top of the key.  Kudos for somposing so well though - the diaganol orientation is great!</td>', 'Nice composition, but a bit too much lighting.  I''d like to see a more even tone on the top of the key.  Kudos for somposing so well though - the diaganol orientation is great!', '2004-07-30 09:09:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(833143, 93685, 21714, '<td valign="top">A very beautiful picture. Would love to see it printed. I think it would look even better if it was cropped slightly from the bottom.  Great Work.</td>', 'A very beautiful picture. Would love to see it printed. I think it would look even better if it was cropped slightly from the bottom.  Great Work.', '2004-07-30 09:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(833144, 94073, 20407, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what this is, but I''m pretty sure it''s not something I see often. An interesting idea - I''ll be interested to know the background behind it.</td>', 'I''m not sure what this is, but I''m pretty sure it''s not something I see often. An interesting idea - I''ll be interested to know the background behind it.', '2004-07-30 09:10:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(833145, 92721, 20204, '<td valign="top">With this silhouette it''s almost impossible to pick out the mug...  I''d suggest trying to make your subject more defined.</td>', 'With this silhouette it''s almost impossible to pick out the mug...  I''d suggest trying to make your subject more defined.', '2004-07-30 09:10:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(833146, 93626, 20204, '<td valign="top">Too much distraction in the background.</td>', 'Too much distraction in the background.', '2004-07-30 09:12:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(833147, 93927, 23251, '<td valign="top">What a shame the bit on the right was not cropped. Lovely shot otherwise.</td>', 'What a shame the bit on the right was not cropped. Lovely shot otherwise.', '2004-07-30 09:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(833148, 92864, 20407, '<td valign="top">I think it would help if the salt and pepper shakers were the same containers. I''d also bring the viewpoint down a little so that you can see them more direclty in front of you.</td>', 'I think it would help if the salt and pepper shakers were the same containers. I''d also bring the viewpoint down a little so that you can see them more direclty in front of you.', '2004-07-30 09:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(833149, 93053, 23560, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful.</td>', 'This is beautiful.', '2004-07-30 09:13:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(833151, 93853, 20407, '<td valign="top">There is a lot to look at in this photo. I''d remove all of the distracting elements and focus on the watch. The lighting is quite dramatic though.</td>', 'There is a lot to look at in this photo. I''d remove all of the distracting elements and focus on the watch. The lighting is quite dramatic though.', '2004-07-30 09:14:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(833152, 93312, 20204, '<td valign="top">I like the use of b/w in this image.</td>', 'I like the use of b/w in this image.', '2004-07-30 09:14:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(833153, 93233, 23560, '<td valign="top">This is so beautiful it''s surreal!</td>', 'This is so beautiful it''s surreal!', '2004-07-30 09:15:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(833154, 93897, 20407, '<td valign="top">This is a nice snapshot which contains a lot of everyday objects.  It would benefit it to focus on one main thing rather than all of them.</td>', 'This is a nice snapshot which contains a lot of everyday objects.  It would benefit it to focus on one main thing rather than all of them.', '2004-07-30 09:15:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(833155, 92895, 20407, '<td valign="top">Wow, I hope he didn''t bite you! You could do with a little less lighting on his head - it''s a little hard to tell what it is at first.</td>', 'Wow, I hope he didn''t bite you! You could do with a little less lighting on his head - it''s a little hard to tell what it is at first.', '2004-07-30 09:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(833156, 93531, 20204, '<td valign="top">Creative use of filters...  This would never have worked as a traditional image.  I''d never hang it on my walls, but kudos for creativity.</td>', 'Creative use of filters...  This would never have worked as a traditional image.  I''d never hang it on my walls, but kudos for creativity.', '2004-07-30 09:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(833158, 93240, 20407, '<td valign="top">The lighting is a little dull. It would help to rotate the image so that the clock was straight.</td>', 'The lighting is a little dull. It would help to rotate the image so that the clock was straight.', '2004-07-30 09:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(833159, 93808, 23560, '<td valign="top">Great work on the focus and composition</td>', 'Great work on the focus and composition', '2004-07-30 09:18:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(833160, 93157, 23560, '<td valign="top">Stunning. Wonderful colors!</td>', 'Stunning. Wonderful colors!', '2004-07-30 09:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(833161, 93604, 23560, '<td valign="top">Great mood and color.</td>', 'Great mood and color.', '2004-07-30 09:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(833162, 93107, 20204, '<td valign="top">Not enough of this image is in focus.</td>', 'Not enough of this image is in focus.', '2004-07-30 09:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(833163, 92912, 20407, '<td valign="top">Scary exploding flowers! This is a bit weird, I don''t see plants do this every day.</td>', 'Scary exploding flowers! This is a bit weird, I don''t see plants do this every day.', '2004-07-30 09:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(833165, 94118, 23560, '<td valign="top">Hmmm...Gangs of New York anyone? I would''ve liked to see a plainer background to emphasize the grittiness of the knife. But that''s just me. This is great!</td>', 'Hmmm...Gangs of New York anyone? I would''ve liked to see a plainer background to emphasize the grittiness of the knife. But that''s just me. This is great!', '2004-07-30 09:20:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(833166, 92966, 23560, '<td valign="top">The focus is superb. I just wish the full keychain was in frame.</td>', 'The focus is superb. I just wish the full keychain was in frame.', '2004-07-30 09:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
