(833238, 93779, 19841, '<td valign="top">Good idea and composition, just needs a little more punch on the lighting  .What this lacks is some light on the edges of the knives, to give them a glint of sharpness.  As it is, they could almost be paper cutouts.  Really stark lighting would accent your idea.</td>', 'Good idea and composition, just needs a little more punch on the lighting  .What this lacks is some light on the edges of the knives, to give them a glint of sharpness.  As it is, they could almost be paper cutouts.  Really stark lighting would accent your idea.', '2004-07-30 10:26:51.000000', NULL, 1),
