(833279, 93903, 15891, '<td valign="top">I originally rated this a 7 but now that I''ve come back to leave a comment, I''m raising my score to a 9. Why? I like the way the blur suggests movement (appropriate for the subject) while the in-focus part of the image treats the viewer to that nice swirl on the top. Overall, the image could be just a touch brighter but as it is, the lighting imparts an interesting moodiness typically not found in images like this.  Nice job :-)</td>', 'I originally rated this a 7 but now that I''ve come back to leave a comment, I''m raising my score to a 9. Why? I like the way the blur suggests movement (appropriate for the subject) while the in-focus part of the image treats the viewer to that nice swirl on the top. Overall, the image could be just a touch brighter but as it is, the lighting imparts an interesting moodiness typically not found in images like this.  Nice job :-)', '2004-07-30 11:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
