(833330, 93926, 19608, '<td valign="top">This image has so much potential - it is a classic "layering" of colors in nature.  The breaking of the layers by the vertical pole and life saver is a perfect touch.  But, and in this case it''s a big but... the crooked horizon pretty much ruins the effect.  Do it again being very careful with the horizon - you will like it much better.</td>', 'This image has so much potential - it is a classic "layering" of colors in nature.  The breaking of the layers by the vertical pole and life saver is a perfect touch.  But, and in this case it''s a big but... the crooked horizon pretty much ruins the effect.  Do it again being very careful with the horizon - you will like it much better.', '2004-07-30 12:11:01.000000', NULL, 1),
