(833668, 93366, 20779, '<td valign="top">Very cool composition for the challenge; would really pop with a sharper focus.</td>', 'Very cool composition for the challenge; would really pop with a sharper focus.', '2004-07-30 16:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(833669, 93859, 20779, '<td valign="top">Terrific abstract and title.</td>', 'Terrific abstract and title.', '2004-07-30 16:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(833673, 94024, 20779, '<td valign="top">Love the colors and gleem. To improve it, I might try a looser crop or try playing around with the balance of the composition. It would also benefit from a starker white background.</td>', 'Love the colors and gleem. To improve it, I might try a looser crop or try playing around with the balance of the composition. It would also benefit from a starker white background.', '2004-07-30 16:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(833675, 94045, 20779, '<td valign="top">Precious expression you caught. The focus is a bit soft and the crop a little tight for my taste, giving it a bit of the "snapshot" feel.</td>', 'Precious expression you caught. The focus is a bit soft and the crop a little tight for my taste, giving it a bit of the "snapshot" feel.', '2004-07-30 16:51:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(833676, 93165, 20779, '<td valign="top">Great shot for what it is, and the background works well. My only reservation is the centeredness and lack of anything "interesting" outside of it meeting the challenge.</td>', 'Great shot for what it is, and the background works well. My only reservation is the centeredness and lack of anything "interesting" outside of it meeting the challenge.', '2004-07-30 16:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(833677, 94059, 20779, '<td valign="top">Very well done; the detail and perspective are excellent.</td>', 'Very well done; the detail and perspective are excellent.', '2004-07-30 16:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(833678, 93857, 19608, '<td valign="top">Very graphic and nicely done.  Don''t think you need the area below the glass and above the border - although it would be a perfect spot for text.</td>', 'Very graphic and nicely done.  Don''t think you need the area below the glass and above the border - although it would be a perfect spot for text.', '2004-07-30 16:53:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(833679, 93817, 20779, '<td valign="top">Terrific clarity and movement in the shot; I wish there was a slightly stronger focus of "interest" to rest on.</td>', 'Terrific clarity and movement in the shot; I wish there was a slightly stronger focus of "interest" to rest on.', '2004-07-30 16:54:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(833681, 94103, 20779, '<td valign="top">You did a really good job making this much more than a snapshot of a slide! Great perspective used.</td>', 'You did a really good job making this much more than a snapshot of a slide! Great perspective used.', '2004-07-30 16:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(833682, 94019, 19608, '<td valign="top">Really graphic - nice colors.  I like the "face" at the very top.  The spots throughout are bothersome.</td>', 'Really graphic - nice colors.  I like the "face" at the very top.  The spots throughout are bothersome.', '2004-07-30 16:55:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(833684, 93865, 20779, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. It is hurt by the blurred petal coming out at us unfortunately. I believe the rest of the soft focus is what you were going for. I like the crop you used, also, to add more interest.</td>', 'Beautiful shot. It is hurt by the blurred petal coming out at us unfortunately. I believe the rest of the soft focus is what you were going for. I like the crop you used, also, to add more interest.', '2004-07-30 16:57:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(833686, 93849, 19608, '<td valign="top">Excellent concept.  The hair is gorgeous - both in color and texture.  The really hot areas on the hands and hair dryer really hurt the image.</td>', 'Excellent concept.  The hair is gorgeous - both in color and texture.  The really hot areas on the hands and hair dryer really hurt the image.', '2004-07-30 16:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(833687, 93749, 20779, '<td valign="top">Lovely. Looks like petals folded back and softly lit. Great idea, composition and lighting.</td>', 'Lovely. Looks like petals folded back and softly lit. Great idea, composition and lighting.', '2004-07-30 16:58:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(833688, 93322, 20779, '<td valign="top">This has a very classic feel to it; one of my favorites in this challenge.</td>', 'This has a very classic feel to it; one of my favorites in this challenge.', '2004-07-30 16:59:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(833689, 93274, 20779, '<td valign="top">Very fun shot with perfect lighting.</td>', 'Very fun shot with perfect lighting.', '2004-07-30 17:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(833691, 93312, 20779, '<td valign="top">Nice shot of a classic arrangement. I wish the spots could have been cleaned up some, but know you can''t with basic editing.</td>', 'Nice shot of a classic arrangement. I wish the spots could have been cleaned up some, but know you can''t with basic editing.', '2004-07-30 17:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(833692, 93206, 20779, '<td valign="top">I love this take on the challenge. Just enough definition to let us know what it is; great abstract and movement in the frame.</td>', 'I love this take on the challenge. Just enough definition to let us know what it is; great abstract and movement in the frame.', '2004-07-30 17:03:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(833693, 94014, 20779, '<td valign="top">The graininess is what makes this shot; good choice!</td>', 'The graininess is what makes this shot; good choice!', '2004-07-30 17:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(833694, 93298, 20779, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting and use of monotones and angle.</td>', 'Beautiful lighting and use of monotones and angle.', '2004-07-30 17:05:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(833695, 93831, 20779, '<td valign="top">Fantastic textures and arrangement.</td>', 'Fantastic textures and arrangement.', '2004-07-30 17:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(833697, 93170, 20779, '<td valign="top">Good perspective; unfortunately, not enough focus for my tastes.</td>', 'Good perspective; unfortunately, not enough focus for my tastes.', '2004-07-30 17:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(833700, 92770, 19978, '<td valign="top">The more I looked at it, the more this photo grew on me. Very appropriate dof, nice sharp focus at the level of the water. the perspective on the spoon is interesting, and the use of light and shadows makes the composition very interesting to look at. I think the light source could have been a bit brighter. Very nice pic though.</td>', 'The more I looked at it, the more this photo grew on me. Very appropriate dof, nice sharp focus at the level of the water. the perspective on the spoon is interesting, and the use of light and shadows makes the composition very interesting to look at. I think the light source could have been a bit brighter. Very nice pic though.', '2004-07-30 17:08:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(833701, 93396, 19978, '<td valign="top">The dark cast over the entire photo works well for me. I like the implied contrast between the low and hi tech, and the display of the calculator is nice (pi). Good pic!</td>', 'The dark cast over the entire photo works well for me. I like the implied contrast between the low and hi tech, and the display of the calculator is nice (pi). Good pic!', '2004-07-30 17:10:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(833704, 93732, 19978, '<td valign="top">Very interesting composition. I love the stark contrast of the black chair on the perfectly white background. I would have liked to see a different crop though, with considerably more use of negative space to really leave the chair stranded in a more open photo.</td>', 'Very interesting composition. I love the stark contrast of the black chair on the perfectly white background. I would have liked to see a different crop though, with considerably more use of negative space to really leave the chair stranded in a more open photo.', '2004-07-30 17:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(833705, 92898, 19978, '<td valign="top">Excellent choice of subject and composition. Meets the challenge very nicely and in a provocative, unusual take on an ordinary object.</td>', 'Excellent choice of subject and composition. Meets the challenge very nicely and in a provocative, unusual take on an ordinary object.', '2004-07-30 17:14:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(833707, 93831, 19978, '<td valign="top">Yeah, it''s dirty! Very unusual coloring and texture, but I like the composition overall.</td>', 'Yeah, it''s dirty! Very unusual coloring and texture, but I like the composition overall.', '2004-07-30 17:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(833709, 93858, 19978, '<td valign="top">Very sharp focus, which is necessary to compliment the stark lines of the BW. While I like the image as is, I''d like to have seen a wider crop with more empty or negative space. It looks like the corner of  a wood surface (table?), maybe a bit more of the expanse of the tabletop. The whitish, lined object just beyond the subjects is a bit distracting.</td>', 'Very sharp focus, which is necessary to compliment the stark lines of the BW. While I like the image as is, I''d like to have seen a wider crop with more empty or negative space. It looks like the corner of  a wood surface (table?), maybe a bit more of the expanse of the tabletop. The whitish, lined object just beyond the subjects is a bit distracting.', '2004-07-30 17:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(833711, 94014, 19978, '<td valign="top">Outstanding idea, composition, and crop. I like the BW choice too, but I think the graininess is going to work against this image. I''d like to see it done with a bit more sharpness and texture (hands are great, IMHO), and the coins work well, but again, too grainy.</td>', 'Outstanding idea, composition, and crop. I like the BW choice too, but I think the graininess is going to work against this image. I''d like to see it done with a bit more sharpness and texture (hands are great, IMHO), and the coins work well, but again, too grainy.', '2004-07-30 17:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(833712, 93657, 19978, '<td valign="top">...and quite a dirty fence! I love the composition. It looks a bit soft overall. I would have liked to see better detail in the ground (plants, soil, etc.) and better relief in the texture of the wood and paint. I like the choice of BW and the crop. Very nice effort and meets the challenge well, IMO.</td>', '...and quite a dirty fence! I love the composition. It looks a bit soft overall. I would have liked to see better detail in the ground (plants, soil, etc.) and better relief in the texture of the wood and paint. I like the choice of BW and the crop. Very nice effort and meets the challenge well, IMO.', '2004-07-30 17:23:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(833713, 94089, 19978, '<td valign="top">Very nice idea and execution. Photo angle, lighting and crop are all excellent. I would probably have opted for just one mousetrap and a bit tighter crop (or just make use of the resulting negative space). Nice creative response to the challenge!</td>', 'Very nice idea and execution. Photo angle, lighting and crop are all excellent. I would probably have opted for just one mousetrap and a bit tighter crop (or just make use of the resulting negative space). Nice creative response to the challenge!', '2004-07-30 17:24:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(833714, 94095, 19978, '<td valign="top">Very cool concept! The shallow DOF works against you though, I think. I''d like to see the foreground bubble sharp all the way around. One of the more creative responses to this challenge though, nice going!</td>', 'Very cool concept! The shallow DOF works against you though, I think. I''d like to see the foreground bubble sharp all the way around. One of the more creative responses to this challenge though, nice going!', '2004-07-30 17:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(833715, 94086, 19978, '<td valign="top">Lovely textures in the subject and the velvet background. Nice simple approach to the challenge. Bravo!</td>', 'Lovely textures in the subject and the velvet background. Nice simple approach to the challenge. Bravo!', '2004-07-30 17:27:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(833716, 93170, 19978, '<td valign="top">I love this image! though I think you didn''t realize its potential. The shallow DOF probably works a little against you. the inlaid patterning around the hole is probably beautiful and would have worked nicely if it was at least partially focused. Outstanding response to the challenge!</td>', 'I love this image! though I think you didn''t realize its potential. The shallow DOF probably works a little against you. the inlaid patterning around the hole is probably beautiful and would have worked nicely if it was at least partially focused. Outstanding response to the challenge!', '2004-07-30 17:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(833717, 93982, 19978, '<td valign="top">Nice repetitive symmetry, and very nice textures on the pencils. The soft lighting works well but I wish it were a bit brighter, though it looks like you were narrowly avoiding some burned out areas already. Nice response to the challenge.</td>', 'Nice repetitive symmetry, and very nice textures on the pencils. The soft lighting works well but I wish it were a bit brighter, though it looks like you were narrowly avoiding some burned out areas already. Nice response to the challenge.', '2004-07-30 17:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(833727, 93989, 6130, '<td valign="top">Amazing.10</td>', 'Amazing.10', '2004-07-30 17:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(833731, 93721, 6130, '<td valign="top">I love the simplicity of this.10</td>', 'I love the simplicity of this.10', '2004-07-30 17:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(833733, 94015, 6130, '<td valign="top">Very funny.</td>', 'Very funny.', '2004-07-30 17:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(833739, 92895, 20779, '<td valign="top">The beak over-powers the focus on the eye, and the blown highlights of the upper left of the frame are too powerful to ignore IMO for this to score well.</td>', 'The beak over-powers the focus on the eye, and the blown highlights of the upper left of the frame are too powerful to ignore IMO for this to score well.', '2004-07-30 18:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(833740, 93240, 20779, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what you were wanting to achieve for your vision, but the problems I see are poor focus, tilt not corrected, lack of overall tonal range, and no real "interest" in the shot IMO.</td>', 'I don''t know what you were wanting to achieve for your vision, but the problems I see are poor focus, tilt not corrected, lack of overall tonal range, and no real "interest" in the shot IMO.', '2004-07-30 18:08:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(833741, 93531, 20779, '<td valign="top">The contrasty color effects are too overdone in my opinion.</td>', 'The contrasty color effects are too overdone in my opinion.', '2004-07-30 18:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(833743, 93845, 20779, '<td valign="top">Water was well captured. The crop is too tight for me and you will probably see lower scores due to the size you took your image down to. Overall, this appears more like a "snapshot" to me, without a lot of interest, but that is just an opinion.</td>', 'Water was well captured. The crop is too tight for me and you will probably see lower scores due to the size you took your image down to. Overall, this appears more like a "snapshot" to me, without a lot of interest, but that is just an opinion.', '2004-07-30 18:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(833745, 93054, 20779, '<td valign="top">I like the artsy feel, but it may be a bit too closely cropped and sized. The graininess is just a bit too much, and the blown highlights unfortunatley can''t be fixed in basic editing.</td>', 'I like the artsy feel, but it may be a bit too closely cropped and sized. The graininess is just a bit too much, and the blown highlights unfortunatley can''t be fixed in basic editing.', '2004-07-30 18:14:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(833747, 93837, 22180, '<td valign="top">would be better, if not cropped at top</td>', 'would be better, if not cropped at top', '2004-07-30 18:15:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(833768, 93206, 772, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent abstract view of an every day object :)  I love the color and contrast... great work :) = 10</td>', 'This is an excellent abstract view of an every day object :)  I love the color and contrast... great work :) = 10', '2004-07-30 18:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(833770, 93865, 772, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot... love the softness and the light... = 10</td>', 'Beautiful shot... love the softness and the light... = 10', '2004-07-30 18:32:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(833773, 93100, 7711, '<td valign="top">this is hilarious! I love it. What a cool idea to pep up an "everyday" picture of your cheerios. I think the bg could have been improved with some other colour or some items of interest back there...as it is, its bland and isn''t adding anything to the shot.</td>', 'this is hilarious! I love it. What a cool idea to pep up an "everyday" picture of your cheerios. I think the bg could have been improved with some other colour or some items of interest back there...as it is, its bland and isn''t adding anything to the shot.', '2004-07-30 18:33:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(833778, 93986, 509, '<td valign="top">While I think the idea of using a toilet for this challenge is actually pretty good, I''m sure the execution could be done better.  The angle presented is not altogether interesting, something lower at an angle would work much better imho.  The chosen composition does not present the subject in a very interesting way.</td>', 'While I think the idea of using a toilet for this challenge is actually pretty good, I''m sure the execution could be done better.  The angle presented is not altogether interesting, something lower at an angle would work much better imho.  The chosen composition does not present the subject in a very interesting way.', '2004-07-30 18:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(833790, 92899, 20779, '<td valign="top">Beautiful horse and capture. I think it would help to frame the composition less like a snapshot (IMHO) and more in line with a composition in mind, and the focus is too blurry overall. If the horse is blurry for motion, it would still be good to have the background crisp and vice-versa.</td>', 'Beautiful horse and capture. I think it would help to frame the composition less like a snapshot (IMHO) and more in line with a composition in mind, and the focus is too blurry overall. If the horse is blurry for motion, it would still be good to have the background crisp and vice-versa.', '2004-07-30 19:09:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(833793, 94058, 20779, '<td valign="top">Cute wall, but this still feels too much like a "snapshot" for me. Focus is also a bit off.</td>', 'Cute wall, but this still feels too much like a "snapshot" for me. Focus is also a bit off.', '2004-07-30 19:11:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(833795, 93697, 20779, '<td valign="top">I think that this shot could be helped by a crisper focus . I am not sure B &amp; W is a good choice here, but can''t tell without comparing to color. It is an interesting take, but not compelling to look at IMHO.</td>', 'I think that this shot could be helped by a crisper focus . I am not sure B & W is a good choice here, but can''t tell without comparing to color. It is an interesting take, but not compelling to look at IMHO.', '2004-07-30 19:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(833797, 93080, 20779, '<td valign="top">I am not sure what you wanted here, but for me there is no real interest or focus here. Has a "snapshot" look, also.</td>', 'I am not sure what you wanted here, but for me there is no real interest or focus here. Has a "snapshot" look, also.', '2004-07-30 19:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(833798, 93767, 24511, '<td valign="top">I believe the lines of the spoon, the coffee bean bowl, the background glass and especially the pouring liquid direct my gaze perfectly to the cup (focal).  What a great composer you are.  My first 10 this challenge</td>', 'I believe the lines of the spoon, the coffee bean bowl, the background glass and especially the pouring liquid direct my gaze perfectly to the cup (focal).  What a great composer you are.  My first 10 this challenge', '2004-07-30 19:16:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(833799, 94117, 20779, '<td valign="top">Great work on the egg shell and set-up. IMO, the yolk and foreground is too out of focus and the color of the foreground detracts. I would also try to keep the uppermost light as the only light source rather than having the two highlights.</td>', 'Great work on the egg shell and set-up. IMO, the yolk and foreground is too out of focus and the color of the foreground detracts. I would also try to keep the uppermost light as the only light source rather than having the two highlights.', '2004-07-30 19:17:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(833801, 93111, 24511, '<td valign="top">Use of shade and light exposed your subject with vivid accuracy.  Wow!</td>', 'Use of shade and light exposed your subject with vivid accuracy.  Wow!', '2004-07-30 19:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(833802, 93986, 20779, '<td valign="top">This may be everyday, but this just doesn''t work for me. It doesn''t have any real composition (for me), good focus or lighting.</td>', 'This may be everyday, but this just doesn''t work for me. It doesn''t have any real composition (for me), good focus or lighting.', '2004-07-30 19:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(833805, 93989, 20779, '<td valign="top">Beautiful moon scene; I would like a little sharper focus and a bit more color/contrast ideally.</td>', 'Beautiful moon scene; I would like a little sharper focus and a bit more color/contrast ideally.', '2004-07-30 19:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(833809, 94044, 20779, '<td valign="top">Shot very well, but no interest in the composition for me. I think maybe if you tried a different crop to get a different perspective, you might see other possibilities. IMHO, it isn''t a particularly attractive apple to beign with, but who am I to fault Mother Nature? lol</td>', 'Shot very well, but no interest in the composition for me. I think maybe if you tried a different crop to get a different perspective, you might see other possibilities. IMHO, it isn''t a particularly attractive apple to beign with, but who am I to fault Mother Nature? lol', '2004-07-30 19:21:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(833814, 93682, 20779, '<td valign="top">Great focus and lighting. The only fault I can cite (no pun intended) is that it doesn''t have a compelling composition of space for me. I think the slightly soft focus is perfect.</td>', 'Great focus and lighting. The only fault I can cite (no pun intended) is that it doesn''t have a compelling composition of space for me. I think the slightly soft focus is perfect.', '2004-07-30 19:22:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(833818, 93722, 24511, '<td valign="top">The blue key stands out supported by the light blue background.  Seeing the direction of adventure bound by the reflection is inviting anyone to get up and go.  Excellent title.</td>', 'The blue key stands out supported by the light blue background.  Seeing the direction of adventure bound by the reflection is inviting anyone to get up and go.  Excellent title.', '2004-07-30 19:25:34.000000', NULL, 1),
