(833822, 94007, 3102, '<td valign="top">I''m very curious to see how you did this without getting your reflection (as I''m sure others are)!  A supurb image, I must say.  - 10</td>', 'I''m very curious to see how you did this without getting your reflection (as I''m sure others are)!  A supurb image, I must say.  - 10', '2004-07-30 19:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
