(833981, 94059, 19978, '<td valign="top">A beautifully sharp and detailed image of a device we all use every day, but almost never see. The lighting and photographer''s angle are very well done and the sharpness is just right. I like the green circuit-board background and I assume the 1''s and 0''s on the disc are a reflection you created by hoisting some sort of a backdrop for that purpose. Very well thought out and nicely executed.</td>', 'A beautifully sharp and detailed image of a device we all use every day, but almost never see. The lighting and photographer''s angle are very well done and the sharpness is just right. I like the green circuit-board background and I assume the 1''s and 0''s on the disc are a reflection you created by hoisting some sort of a backdrop for that purpose. Very well thought out and nicely executed.', '2004-07-30 22:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(833983, 92810, 19134, '<td valign="top">Nice job! 8</td>', 'Nice job! 8', '2004-07-30 22:01:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(833984, 94074, 19978, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I didn''t know they made those in colored plastics. The shallow dof works well for me in this image, and I like the white surface/lighting/shadows effect.</td>', 'Very nice. I didn''t know they made those in colored plastics. The shallow dof works well for me in this image, and I like the white surface/lighting/shadows effect.', '2004-07-30 22:02:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(833985, 93207, 19978, '<td valign="top">The black backdrop, the exposure, the glow, the crop: they all work for me. After viewing too many remote control shots in this challenge, your phone shot was a welcome surprise!</td>', 'The black backdrop, the exposure, the glow, the crop: they all work for me. After viewing too many remote control shots in this challenge, your phone shot was a welcome surprise!', '2004-07-30 22:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(833987, 93837, 19978, '<td valign="top">An exceptionally beautiful building, and a very nice picture, but it feels rather like you found the current challenge an excuse to take a photo you really wanted to take (pardon if I''m off base here). It''s hard to see a building as an "object."</td>', 'An exceptionally beautiful building, and a very nice picture, but it feels rather like you found the current challenge an excuse to take a photo you really wanted to take (pardon if I''m off base here). It''s hard to see a building as an "object."', '2004-07-30 22:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(833988, 92879, 19978, '<td valign="top">Is that a stylus? Holy smokes Batman, how many of the members of DPC are actually old enough to remember these? Very well conceived but I wish the record surface was blacker. It''s very shiny and reflective, but that whitish cast is distracting.</td>', 'Is that a stylus? Holy smokes Batman, how many of the members of DPC are actually old enough to remember these? Very well conceived but I wish the record surface was blacker. It''s very shiny and reflective, but that whitish cast is distracting.', '2004-07-30 22:08:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(833989, 93452, 19978, '<td valign="top">I didn''t think much of this at first glance, but it has really grown on me. Very simple and elegant - the kind of picture I often striive for. I think your shallow dof really works well, and I love the choice of BW.  I was initially going to give a 6 but I decided it''s one of my favorites in the challenge. 8!</td>', 'I didn''t think much of this at first glance, but it has really grown on me. Very simple and elegant - the kind of picture I often striive for. I think your shallow dof really works well, and I love the choice of BW.  I was initially going to give a 6 but I decided it''s one of my favorites in the challenge. 8!', '2004-07-30 22:10:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(833992, 93313, 19978, '<td valign="top">Nice concept but the result is a little too burned out. There are lots of potential textures and details that could have been captured with different lighting.</td>', 'Nice concept but the result is a little too burned out. There are lots of potential textures and details that could have been captured with different lighting.', '2004-07-30 22:12:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(833994, 92966, 19978, '<td valign="top">Of the numerous key-themed entires to this challenge, this is my favorite. Wonderfully black background and great lighting on the keys. Love the crop too. 8.</td>', 'Of the numerous key-themed entires to this challenge, this is my favorite. Wonderfully black background and great lighting on the keys. Love the crop too. 8.', '2004-07-30 22:13:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(833996, 93469, 19978, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you''ll get lots of comments on the too-burned background. This concept has great potential with all the textures, shadows, and angles involved.</td>', 'I''m sure you''ll get lots of comments on the too-burned background. This concept has great potential with all the textures, shadows, and angles involved.', '2004-07-30 22:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(833997, 93047, 14614, '<td valign="top">I so get this title! (at least I think I do)  Like the monchromatic approach, good dof, creative take on the old "standard"</td>', 'I so get this title! (at least I think I do)  Like the monchromatic approach, good dof, creative take on the old "standard"', '2004-07-30 22:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
