(834100, 93245, 19978, '<td valign="top">I missed this one my first time through and am glad that I got to study it. Very nicely done. It captures the attention and holds it. What an incredible juxtaposition of inverted and erect images! The blue hue of the sky is striking in contrast to the background greens of the grass and bushes. Very well thought out and striking. I give it a 10.</td>', 'I missed this one my first time through and am glad that I got to study it. Very nicely done. It captures the attention and holds it. What an incredible juxtaposition of inverted and erect images! The blue hue of the sky is striking in contrast to the background greens of the grass and bushes. Very well thought out and striking. I give it a 10.', '2004-07-31 00:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(834101, 93312, 19978, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shades of gray and a mesmerizing repetitive theme. A few of the glasses look dirty, which distracts from the overall impact. I love the crop. Nicely done!</td>', 'Beautiful shades of gray and a mesmerizing repetitive theme. A few of the glasses look dirty, which distracts from the overall impact. I love the crop. Nicely done!', '2004-07-31 00:06:38.000000', NULL, 1),
