(834256, 92906, 8816, '<td valign="top">This looks just like the head and shoulders of a transformer, or if it were in b&amp;w it could be Darth Vader!  This too me is what abstract photography is all about!  It''s about taking a mundane ''everyday object'' and taking a picture of it at a certain angle, light or whatever so it appears to be something else.  Well done! 8</td>', 'This looks just like the head and shoulders of a transformer, or if it were in b&w it could be Darth Vader!  This too me is what abstract photography is all about!  It''s about taking a mundane ''everyday object'' and taking a picture of it at a certain angle, light or whatever so it appears to be something else.  Well done! 8', '2004-07-31 05:10:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(834265, 93150, 22748, '<td valign="top">Brilliant! (doh! no pun intended) It took me a minute to figure out what I was looking at. This is so original and just plain cool to look at. Slightly noisy image, but not too bad. 8.</td>', 'Brilliant! (doh! no pun intended) It took me a minute to figure out what I was looking at. This is so original and just plain cool to look at. Slightly noisy image, but not too bad. 8.', '2004-07-31 05:45:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(834269, 93053, 22748, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is truly fabulous. I love the lighting, colors, and textures. Particularly interesting is the way the light leaves streaks along the inside of the straws. The only thing that bugs me is the bit of fuzz on the second straw from the left side on the middle row. If the image was a tiny bit tidier with respect to that and the very slight noise present, I''m thinking it could be a 10. I say 9.</td>', 'Wow, this is truly fabulous. I love the lighting, colors, and textures. Particularly interesting is the way the light leaves streaks along the inside of the straws. The only thing that bugs me is the bit of fuzz on the second straw from the left side on the middle row. If the image was a tiny bit tidier with respect to that and the very slight noise present, I''m thinking it could be a 10. I say 9.', '2004-07-31 06:01:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(834271, 94063, 22748, '<td valign="top">Fabulous lighting and composition. Nice smooth gold tones. Kinda wierd though, the vase or whatever it is feels like it''s floating in the air. It''s almost surreal. Hmmmm, is that an everyday object? Maybe if you''re a king? It looks gold plated. ;-)</td>', 'Fabulous lighting and composition. Nice smooth gold tones. Kinda wierd though, the vase or whatever it is feels like it''s floating in the air. It''s almost surreal. Hmmmm, is that an everyday object? Maybe if you''re a king? It looks gold plated. ;-)', '2004-07-31 06:03:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(834272, 92859, 3799, '<td valign="top">the letters Ga are very distracting but otherwise a great pic</td>', 'the letters Ga are very distracting but otherwise a great pic', '2004-07-31 06:05:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(834273, 93814, 22748, '<td valign="top">Ha! One of my ideas was mice for this challenge. I even spent an hour or so setting up and photographing my collection of Microsoft Intellimouses, but eventually went with something else.<br/> <br/>This is a great image. The silver and black theme makes it feel very professional, businesslike. The brightest area is kept away from the borders, nice leading lines. Sharp focus and interesting textures on the mouse. This is one of the best in the challenge.</td>', 'Ha! One of my ideas was mice for this challenge. I even spent an hour or so setting up and photographing my collection of Microsoft Intellimouses, but eventually went with something else. This is a great image. The silver and black theme makes it feel very professional, businesslike. The brightest area is kept away from the borders, nice leading lines. Sharp focus and interesting textures on the mouse. This is one of the best in the challenge.', '2004-07-31 06:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(834276, 94058, 22748, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject. The lighting and exposure are good. Technically a good photograph. The composition feels very dull though. Maybe another camera angle (lower, or to the side, or both) would add some more interest.</td>', 'Interesting subject. The lighting and exposure are good. Technically a good photograph. The composition feels very dull though. Maybe another camera angle (lower, or to the side, or both) would add some more interest.', '2004-07-31 06:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(834278, 93767, 22748, '<td valign="top">This is tremendously stupendously great. The composition is fantastic. Gorgeous black and white processing job, please describe how you did the B&amp;W conversion! (My mono images always feel so dead.)  Look, I just noticed there is steam coming from the cup. That''s a great detail.<br/> <br/>I could question what the "everyday object" is here, but from the title it seems to be the fuel, the brewed coffee being poured into the cup. If this image were any less wonderful, I would knock off a point or two because I don''t think a liquid is an ''object''.  But in this case, I will make an exception, because everything else is absolutely perfect. 10!</td>', 'This is tremendously stupendously great. The composition is fantastic. Gorgeous black and white processing job, please describe how you did the B&W conversion! (My mono images always feel so dead.)  Look, I just noticed there is steam coming from the cup. That''s a great detail. I could question what the "everyday object" is here, but from the title it seems to be the fuel, the brewed coffee being poured into the cup. If this image were any less wonderful, I would knock off a point or two because I don''t think a liquid is an ''object''.  But in this case, I will make an exception, because everything else is absolutely perfect. 10!', '2004-07-31 06:12:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(834279, 93865, 22748, '<td valign="top">Cool image. It makes you think for a second and question what you''re looking at. (But, regular butterflies, the insect kind, are organic too, right?)</td>', 'Cool image. It makes you think for a second and question what you''re looking at. (But, regular butterflies, the insect kind, are organic too, right?)', '2004-07-31 06:14:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(834289, 93543, 22748, '<td valign="top">Nice. Very well centered; there''s not much worse than a composition that obviously was intended to be centered, but is off by a a hair. I like the viewpoint.</td>', 'Nice. Very well centered; there''s not much worse than a composition that obviously was intended to be centered, but is off by a a hair. I like the viewpoint.', '2004-07-31 06:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(834298, 93511, 7252, '<td valign="top">Nice angelic image but there are a couple of things that bother me. The way the wing elastic goes around her arm really cuts and disjoints her arm from her body. Either a looser strap or something more closely colored to her skin might help. The lower wing edge kind of grows out of her shoulder and at first glance I thought she had a really huge arm. Perhaps some back lighting to define the wing and make it look less like it''s part of her arm.<br/> <br/>Might also move her further away from the wall to gain some separation so the wall texture doesn''t play as big a role.</td>', 'Nice angelic image but there are a couple of things that bother me. The way the wing elastic goes around her arm really cuts and disjoints her arm from her body. Either a looser strap or something more closely colored to her skin might help. The lower wing edge kind of grows out of her shoulder and at first glance I thought she had a really huge arm. Perhaps some back lighting to define the wing and make it look less like it''s part of her arm. Might also move her further away from the wall to gain some separation so the wall texture doesn''t play as big a role.', '2004-07-31 06:58:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(834304, 92828, 18505, '<td valign="top">I''ll take that Rebel off your hands if you don''t want it anymore :&gt;  (I know exactly what you mean by this....  10.</td>', 'I''ll take that Rebel off your hands if you don''t want it anymore :>  (I know exactly what you mean by this....  10.', '2004-07-31 07:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
