(834347, 93145, 24486, '<td valign="top">A very interesting composition. I like the way you have put the subjects of your title slightly off centre. It makes the viewer (well me anyway)  want to look all over the photograph. As an added bonus to the shot, I like your choice of photographic examples.Well done.</td>', 'A very interesting composition. I like the way you have put the subjects of your title slightly off centre. It makes the viewer (well me anyway)  want to look all over the photograph. As an added bonus to the shot, I like your choice of photographic examples.Well done.', '2004-07-31 10:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
