(834350, 93929, 19841, '<td valign="top">I just can''t develop a taste for grey food.  Sepia tone would have been more appealing. Nice composition, with the curves and straight lines.</td>', 'I just can''t develop a taste for grey food.  Sepia tone would have been more appealing. Nice composition, with the curves and straight lines.', '2004-07-31 10:02:25.000000', NULL, 1),
