(834354, 93432, 24486, '<td valign="top">Although a little cliched, everyone loves a good sunrise or sunset photograph and this is another great example of what happens when you get it right. Picture postcard stuff here. Well done.</td>', 'Although a little cliched, everyone loves a good sunrise or sunset photograph and this is another great example of what happens when you get it right. Picture postcard stuff here. Well done.', '2004-07-31 10:13:53.000000', NULL, 1),
