(834517, 94026, 20613, '<td valign="top">In my opinion, this picture would have done better in color.  It''s also hard to tell if anything is actually in focus...I know that they are q-tips, but it seems as though nothing is in sharp, clear focus.</td>', 'In my opinion, this picture would have done better in color.  It''s also hard to tell if anything is actually in focus...I know that they are q-tips, but it seems as though nothing is in sharp, clear focus.', '2004-07-31 15:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
