(834727, 93858, 22748, '<td valign="top">Hmmmmm, I only see two musketeers. Nice composition and lighting though. I love the sliver and gray tones, and the similarity of shape and texture that the mouse and phone have.<br/> <br/>But the edge visible near the bottom of the picture is bothersome, as is the projection of light onto the background, it looks like it''s coming through some blinds or a grate or something. Other than those two details, this is fantastic.</td>', 'Hmmmmm, I only see two musketeers. Nice composition and lighting though. I love the sliver and gray tones, and the similarity of shape and texture that the mouse and phone have. But the edge visible near the bottom of the picture is bothersome, as is the projection of light onto the background, it looks like it''s coming through some blinds or a grate or something. Other than those two details, this is fantastic.', '2004-07-31 21:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
