(834881, 93053, 22011, '<td valign="top">The bits of hair / dust on a couple of the straws is quite distracting, but appart from those minor bits this is a stunning abstract, well done...</td>', 'The bits of hair / dust on a couple of the straws is quite distracting, but appart from those minor bits this is a stunning abstract, well done...', '2004-08-01 01:12:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(834882, 92979, 24511, '<td valign="top">I found the horizontal line at the back a distraction.  I loved the thin red/orange trim within the bulb.  Excellent theme.  The main subject was bright and clear as daylight.</td>', 'I found the horizontal line at the back a distraction.  I loved the thin red/orange trim within the bulb.  Excellent theme.  The main subject was bright and clear as daylight.', '2004-08-01 01:12:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(834883, 93308, 3649, '<td valign="top">feels like morning. It seems a little washed in the darker areas, but I don''t really mind it. the softness also fits the image well. background isn''t *too* distracting. Nice capture. -7</td>', 'feels like morning. It seems a little washed in the darker areas, but I don''t really mind it. the softness also fits the image well. background isn''t *too* distracting. Nice capture. -7', '2004-08-01 01:14:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(834884, 93811, 24511, '<td valign="top">The bright white of the boat has my attention immediately turned to the focal point despite the dramatic sky.  Bravo.</td>', 'The bright white of the boat has my attention immediately turned to the focal point despite the dramatic sky.  Bravo.', '2004-08-01 01:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(834887, 92770, 3649, '<td valign="top">there''s something I really like about this image - the specular highlights and the subtle ripples are great, even if I can''t, for the life of me, figure out what it is. perhaps better suited to an "abstract" challenge. nonetheless, I dig it.</td>', 'there''s something I really like about this image - the specular highlights and the subtle ripples are great, even if I can''t, for the life of me, figure out what it is. perhaps better suited to an "abstract" challenge. nonetheless, I dig it.', '2004-08-01 01:18:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(834888, 93696, 19831, '<td valign="top">Great idea. Very original. I like it. It is a neat perspective.</td>', 'Great idea. Very original. I like it. It is a neat perspective.', '2004-08-01 01:18:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(834889, 94007, 3649, '<td valign="top">great choice of perspectives to eliminate (nearly) your reflection. magnificent setting and excellent job on choosing your DOF. The crop lends a great balance to the image. [8]</td>', 'great choice of perspectives to eliminate (nearly) your reflection. magnificent setting and excellent job on choosing your DOF. The crop lends a great balance to the image. [8]', '2004-08-01 01:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(834890, 93726, 10848, '<td valign="top">nice7</td>', 'nice7', '2004-08-01 01:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(834891, 93248, 19831, '<td valign="top">A nice concept. I think putting the water in a "Guinness" glass doesn''t work very well.</td>', 'A nice concept. I think putting the water in a "Guinness" glass doesn''t work very well.', '2004-08-01 01:21:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(834892, 93685, 24511, '<td valign="top">No mistake here.  The simplicity of shape and color without any background for distraction...Tomato, tomaato, or however you pronouce it...you''ve got my vote.  I never tire of seeing the toutch of water added to a subject.  Must be my aquatics background.</td>', 'No mistake here.  The simplicity of shape and color without any background for distraction...Tomato, tomaato, or however you pronouce it...you''ve got my vote.  I never tire of seeing the toutch of water added to a subject.  Must be my aquatics background.', '2004-08-01 01:21:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(834894, 92744, 3649, '<td valign="top">i like the high-key nature of this shot. The poles at the bottom distract a bit and I think it could benefit from a cropping that puts the sign a little more right and down (therefore knocking out the poles and putting a little more blue sky into the photo). [7]</td>', 'i like the high-key nature of this shot. The poles at the bottom distract a bit and I think it could benefit from a cropping that puts the sign a little more right and down (therefore knocking out the poles and putting a little more blue sky into the photo). [7]', '2004-08-01 01:25:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(834900, 93829, 24511, '<td valign="top">The sun is always a good bet for a sure thing focal point.  The birds really stand out with this background.  Even more so due to the clouds that attract attention with their varied shapes.  The sun''s reflection also creates a path for the eyes to follow upward.  Splendid photo.</td>', 'The sun is always a good bet for a sure thing focal point.  The birds really stand out with this background.  Even more so due to the clouds that attract attention with their varied shapes.  The sun''s reflection also creates a path for the eyes to follow upward.  Splendid photo.', '2004-08-01 01:30:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(834902, 94095, 3649, '<td valign="top">This is a "Wow!" photo. The detail in the bubble (and selected DOF) and the color just blow me away. The soft lighting in the background is great and the way the background fades almost seamlessly just adds to it. Excellent image overall. [9]</td>', 'This is a "Wow!" photo. The detail in the bubble (and selected DOF) and the color just blow me away. The soft lighting in the background is great and the way the background fades almost seamlessly just adds to it. Excellent image overall. [9]', '2004-08-01 01:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(834903, 93887, 19831, '<td valign="top">Wow, do you get up early. Good composition.</td>', 'Wow, do you get up early. Good composition.', '2004-08-01 01:32:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(834911, 93749, 24511, '<td valign="top">Lovely wave formation.  I enjoyed the play of light and shadow.  I was attracted to the large circular lines before noting in the lower edge that this was in fact a notepad.  I liked your photo better at second glance.</td>', 'Lovely wave formation.  I enjoyed the play of light and shadow.  I was attracted to the large circular lines before noting in the lower edge that this was in fact a notepad.  I liked your photo better at second glance.', '2004-08-01 01:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(834920, 93657, 3649, '<td valign="top">wow. the b/w treatment here works wonderfully. the composition is great (good white/black balance) and the gritty nature really hits home. The DOF could be a tad more shallow to blow out the background a little more and the perspective could be *just* a hair lower so as to avoid competition between the foreground pickets and the background pickets. Excellent overall. [9]</td>', 'wow. the b/w treatment here works wonderfully. the composition is great (good white/black balance) and the gritty nature really hits home. The DOF could be a tad more shallow to blow out the background a little more and the perspective could be *just* a hair lower so as to avoid competition between the foreground pickets and the background pickets. Excellent overall. [9]', '2004-08-01 01:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(834922, 93473, 24511, '<td valign="top">Pink Floyd brick in the wall theme gets me rebellious when I see repetitive paterns in this photo.   The closest desk edged by sunlight gives me my focal point...or is it the source of light showing me the exit towards summer vacation?  No color spurs plenty of talk about education with a classroom without teacher or students.</td>', 'Pink Floyd brick in the wall theme gets me rebellious when I see repetitive paterns in this photo.   The closest desk edged by sunlight gives me my focal point...or is it the source of light showing me the exit towards summer vacation?  No color spurs plenty of talk about education with a classroom without teacher or students.', '2004-08-01 01:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(834925, 93715, 19608, '<td valign="top">I really like this.  Your composition and lighting are superb.  It may not be an "everyday object" for some - but it works for me.  The only thing I would suggest for improvement  is to remove the slight magenta cast and make the background a pure white.</td>', 'I really like this.  Your composition and lighting are superb.  It may not be an "everyday object" for some - but it works for me.  The only thing I would suggest for improvement  is to remove the slight magenta cast and make the background a pure white.', '2004-08-01 01:55:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(834926, 93308, 24511, '<td valign="top">Lines of objects and  light/shadow along with the fumes definitely drive my conviction that you nailed this photo challenge.  Can you tell I''m a coffee drinker?</td>', 'Lines of objects and  light/shadow along with the fumes definitely drive my conviction that you nailed this photo challenge.  Can you tell I''m a coffee drinker?', '2004-08-01 01:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(834927, 93749, 19608, '<td valign="top">EXCEPTIONALLY ARTISTIC!  Your lighting could not be better.  It''s sure to be in the top ten but I do have two minor suggestions:  1) Remove the border and 2: Come up with a better title for the final image (you probably need the title here to satify the DPC voters!)   GREAT JOB!!!</td>', 'EXCEPTIONALLY ARTISTIC!  Your lighting could not be better.  It''s sure to be in the top ten but I do have two minor suggestions:  1) Remove the border and 2: Come up with a better title for the final image (you probably need the title here to satify the DPC voters!)   GREAT JOB!!!', '2004-08-01 01:59:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(834929, 93685, 19608, '<td valign="top">A very nice submission with excellent lighting.  I''d suggest rotating the tomato so that the end of the stem was hidden.  Water drops are a great touch.</td>', 'A very nice submission with excellent lighting.  I''d suggest rotating the tomato so that the end of the stem was hidden.  Water drops are a great touch.', '2004-08-01 02:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(834930, 93379, 19608, '<td valign="top">SUPERB - but you have a problem.  The screen does not show in the thumbnail - I sure hope they don''t vote you down because of it!  The small "flaws" in the screening are perfect!  Great composition, lighting - and of course - idea. Good luck.</td>', 'SUPERB - but you have a problem.  The screen does not show in the thumbnail - I sure hope they don''t vote you down because of it!  The small "flaws" in the screening are perfect!  Great composition, lighting - and of course - idea. Good luck.', '2004-08-01 02:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(834933, 93053, 19608, '<td valign="top">Very graphic and well done.  Colors are great.  Border is a bit too much for me.</td>', 'Very graphic and well done.  Colors are great.  Border is a bit too much for me.', '2004-08-01 02:05:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(834935, 93111, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great use of the black background - it makes the orange and greens relly pop.</td>', 'Great use of the black background - it makes the orange and greens relly pop.', '2004-08-01 02:06:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(834937, 94020, 18197, '<td valign="top">Bigger, please.</td>', 'Bigger, please.', '2004-08-01 02:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(834938, 93992, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the bird, vry nice. And I like the contrst between Reds and Greens. But, overall the photo is a bit busy.</td>', 'Nice capture of the bird, vry nice. And I like the contrst between Reds and Greens. But, overall the photo is a bit busy.', '2004-08-01 02:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(834939, 94111, 3649, '<td valign="top">wow. the composition really hit me on this one, as well as the dabs of color and the bold type on the scrub bottle. the front edge of the basin is a little distracting and the lighting is a tad flat, but I really do like the implied gritty nature of the image. [8]</td>', 'wow. the composition really hit me on this one, as well as the dabs of color and the bold type on the scrub bottle. the front edge of the basin is a little distracting and the lighting is a tad flat, but I really do like the implied gritty nature of the image. [8]', '2004-08-01 02:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(834940, 93938, 23251, '<td valign="top">Very nice clean shot!  One of my 2 top photos!</td>', 'Very nice clean shot!  One of my 2 top photos!', '2004-08-01 02:11:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(834941, 93809, 18197, '<td valign="top">Bigger, please.</td>', 'Bigger, please.', '2004-08-01 02:13:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(834942, 93430, 23251, '<td valign="top">I can see the strings!  But seriously I have rated this as 1 of my 2 top photo''s.  Well Done!</td>', 'I can see the strings!  But seriously I have rated this as 1 of my 2 top photo''s.  Well Done!', '2004-08-01 02:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(834943, 92858, 19608, '<td valign="top">Well - at least half of your audience may not agree (males.)  You have a creative idea which is well submitted.  The only thing that bothers me is the heavy border which detracts from your subject(s).  Nice lighting and great title.</td>', 'Well - at least half of your audience may not agree (males.)  You have a creative idea which is well submitted.  The only thing that bothers me is the heavy border which detracts from your subject(s).  Nice lighting and great title.', '2004-08-01 02:13:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(834945, 93721, 24511, '<td valign="top">Great play with words.   I chuckled after reading your title. No disputing the focal point is clearly the pin.  The folds in the cloth and the horizontal clothes line solidify this.  Thanks for submitting.</td>', 'Great play with words.   I chuckled after reading your title. No disputing the focal point is clearly the pin.  The folds in the cloth and the horizontal clothes line solidify this.  Thanks for submitting.', '2004-08-01 02:14:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(834947, 93926, 3649, '<td valign="top">you caught the light perfectly. the composition is great, the colors vivid and it really makes me feel the beach. My only gripe is the unlevel horizon of the water. Otherwise, great capture [9]</td>', 'you caught the light perfectly. the composition is great, the colors vivid and it really makes me feel the beach. My only gripe is the unlevel horizon of the water. Otherwise, great capture [9]', '2004-08-01 02:15:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(834949, 94024, 19608, '<td valign="top">I really like this!  The idea is great as is the composition.  I''d like to see the backgroud as a pure white rather than the "fluorescent green" that you have.  It would also be fun to play around with moving the colors around - interspacing each row.  Good luck!</td>', 'I really like this!  The idea is great as is the composition.  I''d like to see the backgroud as a pure white rather than the "fluorescent green" that you have.  It would also be fun to play around with moving the colors around - interspacing each row.  Good luck!', '2004-08-01 02:17:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(834950, 93947, 3649, '<td valign="top">the colors really pop against the blue sky and the composition is great. It almost looks like they were lit differently from the sun, but I like it. The extra plastic on the blue peg is distracting and could be removed to strengthen the whole image. Without a doubt, the best clothes peg image of the challenge. [8]</td>', 'the colors really pop against the blue sky and the composition is great. It almost looks like they were lit differently from the sun, but I like it. The extra plastic on the blue peg is distracting and could be removed to strengthen the whole image. Without a doubt, the best clothes peg image of the challenge. [8]', '2004-08-01 02:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(834955, 93511, 18068, '<td valign="top">She''s Beautiful.</td>', 'She''s Beautiful.', '2004-08-01 02:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(834957, 93298, 3649, '<td valign="top">excellent... a GREAT toothbrush photo. Old, worn brushes aren''t photogenic, but this new-ish one definitely is. The DOF is essential here and you nailed it spot on. The reflections, the color and duotone-like quality really kicks this up there. It doesn''t hurt to start with a spotless object, either. [10]</td>', 'excellent... a GREAT toothbrush photo. Old, worn brushes aren''t photogenic, but this new-ish one definitely is. The DOF is essential here and you nailed it spot on. The reflections, the color and duotone-like quality really kicks this up there. It doesn''t hurt to start with a spotless object, either. [10]', '2004-08-01 02:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(834959, 94084, 18068, '<td valign="top">Butterflies, everyday objects?</td>', 'Butterflies, everyday objects?', '2004-08-01 02:21:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(834960, 93582, 3649, '<td valign="top">the side-lighting and shadow really bring this fork to the top of the utensils submissions. The unusual framing guides the eye and really gives an otherwise good photo real punch - an OOF foreground that really works. [9]</td>', 'the side-lighting and shadow really bring this fork to the top of the utensils submissions. The unusual framing guides the eye and really gives an otherwise good photo real punch - an OOF foreground that really works. [9]', '2004-08-01 02:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(834965, 93507, 3649, '<td valign="top">the hue, blur and slightly off angle really make this shot. the lighting is subtle and deep. I can''t say exactly what I could improve on here... almost a Matrix-like feel. Excellent. [8]</td>', 'the hue, blur and slightly off angle really make this shot. the lighting is subtle and deep. I can''t say exactly what I could improve on here... almost a Matrix-like feel. Excellent. [8]', '2004-08-01 02:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(834967, 92895, 19608, '<td valign="top">I want to like your idea but have a bit of trouble doing so.  There''s not much meaning for me - nothing much in focus, a lot overexposed, and not an everyday object in my world.</td>', 'I want to like your idea but have a bit of trouble doing so.  There''s not much meaning for me - nothing much in focus, a lot overexposed, and not an everyday object in my world.', '2004-08-01 02:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(834971, 93100, 19608, '<td valign="top">Superb!! Too bad you did not save this for "miniatures."  Great idea, presentation, exposure, composition.</td>', 'Superb!! Too bad you did not save this for "miniatures."  Great idea, presentation, exposure, composition.', '2004-08-01 02:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(834973, 93312, 18068, '<td valign="top">Ill bet this one is a winner or at least second in the challenge.</td>', 'Ill bet this one is a winner or at least second in the challenge.', '2004-08-01 02:29:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(834980, 92769, 24511, '<td valign="top">Disruption to the flow of this nature scene scream the focal point is the more focused fork.  I could believe the blue sky reflexion in the utensil fuels my superstition that the sky in falling.  Fortunately I''m not a viking and your pic-nic tool photo was appreciated.</td>', 'Disruption to the flow of this nature scene scream the focal point is the more focused fork.  I could believe the blue sky reflexion in the utensil fuels my superstition that the sky in falling.  Fortunately I''m not a viking and your pic-nic tool photo was appreciated.', '2004-08-01 02:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(834986, 93411, 24511, '<td valign="top">With such a busy and interesting amount of nick-nacks, I could not find the focal point but enjoyed the antique shopping feel.  Great experience and very vivid photo.</td>', 'With such a busy and interesting amount of nick-nacks, I could not find the focal point but enjoyed the antique shopping feel.  Great experience and very vivid photo.', '2004-08-01 02:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(834989, 93422, 24511, '<td valign="top">I''m no abstact enthousiaste but focal points galore.</td>', 'I''m no abstact enthousiaste but focal points galore.', '2004-08-01 02:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(834993, 94072, 24511, '<td valign="top">The tooth pastes are forming lips that are trying to entrance me to brush twice a day.  Like the illusion on the lower paste, I admit to being in reality a one brush per day person.  Thanks for the advice anyways.</td>', 'The tooth pastes are forming lips that are trying to entrance me to brush twice a day.  Like the illusion on the lower paste, I admit to being in reality a one brush per day person.  Thanks for the advice anyways.', '2004-08-01 02:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(834996, 93808, 22748, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I like how it makes you take a moment and think about what different objects some people other than yourself use every day. The B&amp;W processing is great.  The exposure is perfect. The syringe in the foreground provides a nice leading line drawing the eye towards the bottle. The clean border complements the picture nicely. 9.</td>', 'Very nice. I like how it makes you take a moment and think about what different objects some people other than yourself use every day. The B&W processing is great.  The exposure is perfect. The syringe in the foreground provides a nice leading line drawing the eye towards the bottle. The clean border complements the picture nicely. 9.', '2004-08-01 02:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(835001, 94119, 24511, '<td valign="top">There is nothing as magnetic as someone gaze.  It is even less threatening when inocence is prevalent.  The hidden focal point is wowed to center stage by the contrast of shadow and pure spec of white reflection.  A picture worth a thousand words.</td>', 'There is nothing as magnetic as someone gaze.  It is even less threatening when inocence is prevalent.  The hidden focal point is wowed to center stage by the contrast of shadow and pure spec of white reflection.  A picture worth a thousand words.', '2004-08-01 02:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(835003, 93658, 24511, '<td valign="top">The direction of skin lines and green color brought my attention to the focal point even before understanding the subject at hand.  Great shot.</td>', 'The direction of skin lines and green color brought my attention to the focal point even before understanding the subject at hand.  Great shot.', '2004-08-01 02:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(835006, 93245, 24511, '<td valign="top">Quite the optical used for this photo.  It is brilliant.  Top scores.</td>', 'Quite the optical used for this photo.  It is brilliant.  Top scores.', '2004-08-01 03:07:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(835009, 93306, 24511, '<td valign="top">Superb lighting and reflexion with bright colors contrasting with the seemingly dark as night left of photo.  Wow!</td>', 'Superb lighting and reflexion with bright colors contrasting with the seemingly dark as night left of photo.  Wow!', '2004-08-01 03:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(835010, 94033, 24511, '<td valign="top">Like bees, nature always seems to hold our sights towards amazing focal points.  Great close-up submission.</td>', 'Like bees, nature always seems to hold our sights towards amazing focal points.  Great close-up submission.', '2004-08-01 03:16:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(835011, 93842, 24511, '<td valign="top">Walk this way towards my focal point is the impression I get when I see what seems to be a pointer lifting my eyes towards the sky.  Good job.</td>', 'Walk this way towards my focal point is the impression I get when I see what seems to be a pointer lifting my eyes towards the sky.  Good job.', '2004-08-01 03:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(835013, 93709, 24511, '<td valign="top">Someone once said we should face our problems, not run away from them.  Lovely close-up.</td>', 'Someone once said we should face our problems, not run away from them.  Lovely close-up.', '2004-08-01 03:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(835014, 93949, 24511, '<td valign="top">Popular mechanics wanabe?  Mouse ball in the corner hard drive.  Excellent photography.</td>', 'Popular mechanics wanabe?  Mouse ball in the corner hard drive.  Excellent photography.', '2004-08-01 03:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(835016, 93475, 24511, '<td valign="top">Your self portrait wowed me and I can even see a smiley face with you as the nose, the building as the eyes and the black chalk line at your feet.</td>', 'Your self portrait wowed me and I can even see a smiley face with you as the nose, the building as the eyes and the black chalk line at your feet.', '2004-08-01 03:26:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(835020, 93787, 21576, '<td valign="top">Simple and effective, nice one!</td>', 'Simple and effective, nice one!', '2004-08-01 03:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(835021, 93868, 21576, '<td valign="top">Definately an every day object.</td>', 'Definately an every day object.', '2004-08-01 03:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(835024, 94022, 21576, '<td valign="top">A great idea, but I find it a bit hard to find what is in focus.</td>', 'A great idea, but I find it a bit hard to find what is in focus.', '2004-08-01 03:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(835026, 94007, 12902, '<td valign="top">IT looks like a winner to me. Congratulations. 10</td>', 'IT looks like a winner to me. Congratulations. 10', '2004-08-01 04:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(835031, 93903, 22494, '<td valign="top">The color and focus of this picture are excellent. The way this photograph has been framed makes it slightly abstract too. Great job!</td>', 'The color and focus of this picture are excellent. The way this photograph has been framed makes it slightly abstract too. Great job!', '2004-08-01 04:22:50.000000', NULL, 1);
