(835344, 93633, 4049, '<td valign="top">The choice of fruit as the subject is fine, but what makes a strong photos is the other objects in the background/composition/strong angles and shapes. First, the round container is ugly,as is the ground visible in the photo. the composition of the round container is off, there is more of the roundness cut on the bottom, than on the top. the fruit itself could be arranged more interestingly, in some sort of pattern or with less of a random snapshot feel. also, the best photos are very clean, so you should have hidden the bad/bruised fruit. Your color and lighting is well done, since the fruit looks the appropriate shade.</td>', 'The choice of fruit as the subject is fine, but what makes a strong photos is the other objects in the background/composition/strong angles and shapes. First, the round container is ugly,as is the ground visible in the photo. the composition of the round container is off, there is more of the roundness cut on the bottom, than on the top. the fruit itself could be arranged more interestingly, in some sort of pattern or with less of a random snapshot feel. also, the best photos are very clean, so you should have hidden the bad/bruised fruit. Your color and lighting is well done, since the fruit looks the appropriate shade.', '2004-08-01 12:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(835345, 93922, 22561, '<td valign="top">Good idea needs blacker blacks.</td>', 'Good idea needs blacker blacks.', '2004-08-01 12:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
