(835407, 93093, 22748, '<td valign="top">LOL! That''s pretty cool. Nice idea. Good lighting too, except that the cheese is a little bright in places making it harder to visibly separate from the background. <br/> <br/>That looks like a MS Intellimouse Explorer 4.0. I''ve owned every Intellimouse Explorer model since the beginning, but I hated my 4.0 model and just switched to Logitech''s new MX510, which works much better with games (button integration, ability to pick up and move the mouse). I will admit that the new Intellimouse does have improved resolution relative to the old models, though. But I digress. ;-)</td>', 'LOL! That''s pretty cool. Nice idea. Good lighting too, except that the cheese is a little bright in places making it harder to visibly separate from the background.  That looks like a MS Intellimouse Explorer 4.0. I''ve owned every Intellimouse Explorer model since the beginning, but I hated my 4.0 model and just switched to Logitech''s new MX510, which works much better with games (button integration, ability to pick up and move the mouse). I will admit that the new Intellimouse does have improved resolution relative to the old models, though. But I digress. ;-)', '2004-08-01 13:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(835408, 92859, 21183, '<td valign="top">Very artistic.  Love the focus and the framing.  The black part of the pen just seemed a little ''flat''.  Gave this a 9.</td>', 'Very artistic.  Love the focus and the framing.  The black part of the pen just seemed a little ''flat''.  Gave this a 9.', '2004-08-01 13:39:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(835409, 93982, 21183, '<td valign="top">Love the colours, the clarity of the shaved wood on the pencils and the ''layout''.  Gave it 9.</td>', 'Love the colours, the clarity of the shaved wood on the pencils and the ''layout''.  Gave it 9.', '2004-08-01 13:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(835410, 93638, 22748, '<td valign="top">Nice pic, but I don''t count ''energy'' as an object. The general definition (consulting some dictionaries) seems to be "object:" "A material thing", or "a thing that can cast a shadow".</td>', 'Nice pic, but I don''t count ''energy'' as an object. The general definition (consulting some dictionaries) seems to be "object:" "A material thing", or "a thing that can cast a shadow".', '2004-08-01 13:42:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(835411, 93815, 21183, '<td valign="top">Love the focussing.  Gave it 9.</td>', 'Love the focussing.  Gave it 9.', '2004-08-01 13:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(835413, 93709, 21183, '<td valign="top">Really impressed by this photo.  Love the focus and the close-up.  Pity about the dark top left and bottom right, but realise it would have been impossible to avoid.  Voted a 9.</td>', 'Really impressed by this photo.  Love the focus and the close-up.  Pity about the dark top left and bottom right, but realise it would have been impossible to avoid.  Voted a 9.', '2004-08-01 13:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(835414, 93206, 21183, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colours and clever use of subject. Voted it a 9.</td>', 'Beautiful colours and clever use of subject. Voted it a 9.', '2004-08-01 13:46:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(835415, 93952, 16241, '<td valign="top">the remotes themselves would have been enough, possibly?</td>', 'the remotes themselves would have been enough, possibly?', '2004-08-01 13:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(835417, 93767, 16241, '<td valign="top">very nice contrasts, hooray long last some oomph in a photo.........</td>', 'very nice contrasts, hooray long last some oomph in a photo.........', '2004-08-01 13:47:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(835418, 93082, 16241, '<td valign="top">oh yes, can see this up there with the best</td>', 'oh yes, can see this up there with the best', '2004-08-01 13:48:40.000000', NULL, 1),
