(835562, 93240, 19608, '<td valign="top">Well - time is not an everyday object - but the clock sure is.  The image does not present your idea very well</td>', 'Well - time is not an everyday object - but the clock sure is.  The image does not present your idea very well', '2004-08-01 17:32:45.000000', NULL, 1),
