(835569, 93118, 19608, '<td valign="top">The screw (actually a bolt) is definitely an everyday object.  The photo has little going for it - too centered, not enough in focus, not very interesting.</td>', 'The screw (actually a bolt) is definitely an everyday object.  The photo has little going for it - too centered, not enough in focus, not very interesting.', '2004-08-01 17:36:50.000000', NULL, 1),
