(836147, 92879, 8054, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition of this photo however it looks very over processed. I think if you kept the colors true rather than use an excessive amount of filters it would look much better. Maybe even as a b/w?</td>', 'I really like the composition of this photo however it looks very over processed. I think if you kept the colors true rather than use an excessive amount of filters it would look much better. Maybe even as a b/w?', '2004-08-02 01:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(836151, 94075, 19608, '<td valign="top">The yellow field is nice.  Lighting is also pleasing.  I want to see more of the tree.</td>', 'The yellow field is nice.  Lighting is also pleasing.  I want to see more of the tree.', '2004-08-02 01:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(836159, 93947, 19608, '<td valign="top">I had no idea so many folks would take clothes pegs as their object!  Yours is nice in that the color combinations are really nice.  Bright, simple, and effective image.</td>', 'I had no idea so many folks would take clothes pegs as their object!  Yours is nice in that the color combinations are really nice.  Bright, simple, and effective image.', '2004-08-02 01:45:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(836167, 93825, 19608, '<td valign="top">This works exceptionally well in your high-key presentation.  The subtle colors are excellent.</td>', 'This works exceptionally well in your high-key presentation.  The subtle colors are excellent.', '2004-08-02 01:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(836174, 93312, 19608, '<td valign="top">Well placed - well shot.</td>', 'Well placed - well shot.', '2004-08-02 01:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(836193, 92898, 8054, '<td valign="top">Hey, I have a similar pen cup on my desk at work! Great shot and love the pencils. Exposure is a little bright but might be due to the background messing with my eyes. 8</td>', 'Hey, I have a similar pen cup on my desk at work! Great shot and love the pencils. Exposure is a little bright but might be due to the background messing with my eyes. 8', '2004-08-02 01:53:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(836195, 92834, 22748, '<td valign="top">Oooh!!! This makes me go wow! Love the colors and the refractions in the glass. <br/> <br/>Hmm, some ugly artifacts upon closer inspection, though. Just above the water line in the glass, there is a rough edge, where some touch-up painting has apparently occurred; it''s especially noticable on the right side of the water line. I could be wrong, but those sure look like a messy Photoshop job, too ragged to be part of the otherwise extremely fluid composition.</td>', 'Oooh!!! This makes me go wow! Love the colors and the refractions in the glass.  Hmm, some ugly artifacts upon closer inspection, though. Just above the water line in the glass, there is a rough edge, where some touch-up painting has apparently occurred; it''s especially noticable on the right side of the water line. I could be wrong, but those sure look like a messy Photoshop job, too ragged to be part of the otherwise extremely fluid composition.', '2004-08-02 01:53:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(836206, 93837, 8054, '<td valign="top">This is definitely an interesting church however, I don''t know if I''d consider it an everyday object unless you worked there. The tops of the church seem chopped off especially the second from the left. Photo seems a bit tilted to the right and it appears there is a bit of grain/noise throughout the image.</td>', 'This is definitely an interesting church however, I don''t know if I''d consider it an everyday object unless you worked there. The tops of the church seem chopped off especially the second from the left. Photo seems a bit tilted to the right and it appears there is a bit of grain/noise throughout the image.', '2004-08-02 01:57:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(836209, 93313, 8054, '<td valign="top">Harsh lighting and flat contrast. Little to no details of the toilet tissue.</td>', 'Harsh lighting and flat contrast. Little to no details of the toilet tissue.', '2004-08-02 01:58:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(836220, 93206, 8054, '<td valign="top">Great use of DOF. I also really like the background as it lends nice touch of color to an otherwise colorless subject. Only thing I might have changed is maybe rotate the vessel a few degrees to the right so the bubble would not be visible. 8</td>', 'Great use of DOF. I also really like the background as it lends nice touch of color to an otherwise colorless subject. Only thing I might have changed is maybe rotate the vessel a few degrees to the right so the bubble would not be visible. 8', '2004-08-02 02:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(836231, 93829, 8055, '<td valign="top">Great photo. It would have been better if the sun was little more broghter</td>', 'Great photo. It would have been better if the sun was little more broghter', '2004-08-02 02:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(836235, 93318, 8054, '<td valign="top">Good attempt but there doesn''t seem to be a single point of sharp focus. OK, maybe the lettering on the gray plastic card on the right but I doubt that is the main subject. Lighting is also very bright and harsh.</td>', 'Good attempt but there doesn''t seem to be a single point of sharp focus. OK, maybe the lettering on the gray plastic card on the right but I doubt that is the main subject. Lighting is also very bright and harsh.', '2004-08-02 02:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(836238, 93312, 8054, '<td valign="top">Making sure your glasses are very clean is so important in a shot like this. Excellent composition and symmetry. The lint/specks in the second glass are distracting.</td>', 'Making sure your glasses are very clean is so important in a shot like this. Excellent composition and symmetry. The lint/specks in the second glass are distracting.', '2004-08-02 02:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(836254, 94083, 8054, '<td valign="top">That''s a lot of toast! I like toast but, man, that''s a LOT. Love the background with its wavy lines. I do question the taste of toasted stoneware, however.  :) Also, great job of hiding the photographer in the chrome surface of the toaster for the most part (I can still see you in the upper left corner). If that''s not you then great job! 8</td>', 'That''s a lot of toast! I like toast but, man, that''s a LOT. Love the background with its wavy lines. I do question the taste of toasted stoneware, however.  :) Also, great job of hiding the photographer in the chrome surface of the toaster for the most part (I can still see you in the upper left corner). If that''s not you then great job! 8', '2004-08-02 02:11:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(836259, 93858, 8054, '<td valign="top">Three? I count two (cell phone and mouse). What is the third? The vented surface they are resting on? Since I cannot recognize what that is, I cannot count three items.</td>', 'Three? I count two (cell phone and mouse). What is the third? The vented surface they are resting on? Since I cannot recognize what that is, I cannot count three items.', '2004-08-02 02:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(836263, 94022, 24941, '<td valign="top">Great color, nice arrangement.  I just like it.</td>', 'Great color, nice arrangement.  I just like it.', '2004-08-02 02:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(836272, 92741, 24941, '<td valign="top">Very cool.</td>', 'Very cool.', '2004-08-02 02:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(836273, 94119, 24941, '<td valign="top">Too dark, hard to make out details....</td>', 'Too dark, hard to make out details....', '2004-08-02 02:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(836277, 94087, 8054, '<td valign="top">Very original! I really like this just based on how original it is. You always see re-enactments on TV from certain perspectives but never quite like this. If there was a way to mute the very bright spot on the kettle and onn the spot, I''d give this a 10. How about a 9 instead? Great job!</td>', 'Very original! I really like this just based on how original it is. You always see re-enactments on TV from certain perspectives but never quite like this. If there was a way to mute the very bright spot on the kettle and onn the spot, I''d give this a 10. How about a 9 instead? Great job!', '2004-08-02 02:18:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(836281, 93858, 8055, '<td valign="top">Good concept</td>', 'Good concept', '2004-08-02 02:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
