(836444, 93906, 22748, '<td valign="top">Good composition, just a little grainy. Good lighting and background. I can see a little reflection of a light or somethin in the ''r'' of Crest, though, a small detail.</td>', 'Good composition, just a little grainy. Good lighting and background. I can see a little reflection of a light or somethin in the ''r'' of Crest, though, a small detail.', '2004-08-02 03:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
