(836465, 93809, 22748, '<td valign="top">Nice! This is great, only I wish it were bigger so I could see the details... are you trying to hide that it''s blurry??? Hahaha just kidding. I like the color and texture of the image. It''s small, so 7, otherwise it would be at least a 9.</td>', 'Nice! This is great, only I wish it were bigger so I could see the details... are you trying to hide that it''s blurry??? Hahaha just kidding. I like the color and texture of the image. It''s small, so 7, otherwise it would be at least a 9.', '2004-08-02 03:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
