(836474, 93790, 22748, '<td valign="top">Oooh, second hat picture in a row in my voting, weird. This is nice, I like the angle, combined with the bend in the bridge. Very cool.</td>', 'Oooh, second hat picture in a row in my voting, weird. This is nice, I like the angle, combined with the bend in the bridge. Very cool.', '2004-08-02 03:34:28.000000', NULL, 1),
