(836508, 93806, 22748, '<td valign="top">Oooh, I''m a sucker for bright colors like this. Very nice. It seems a tiny bit overcompressed, though, maybe that''s why there are patchy artifacts on the flat surfaces of the glass, visible especially prominently on the green bottle. It''s kind of distracting. Otherwise, a very good image.</td>', 'Oooh, I''m a sucker for bright colors like this. Very nice. It seems a tiny bit overcompressed, though, maybe that''s why there are patchy artifacts on the flat surfaces of the glass, visible especially prominently on the green bottle. It''s kind of distracting. Otherwise, a very good image.', '2004-08-02 03:54:17.000000', NULL, 1),
