(837208, 94086, 2612, '<td valign="top">Great subject, but I don''t like the background. If these are well worn everyday shoes, show them in the normal surroundings... next to the bed, by the front door, etc.<br/> <br/>Technique is good, so my score will be decent, but there is more that you could do with this subject.</td>', 'Great subject, but I don''t like the background. If these are well worn everyday shoes, show them in the normal surroundings... next to the bed, by the front door, etc. Technique is good, so my score will be decent, but there is more that you could do with this subject.', '2004-08-02 13:51:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(837308, 94101, 24939, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting and the toning. A funny take on the challenge and yup, it certainly is an everyday thing!</td>', 'I like the lighting and the toning. A funny take on the challenge and yup, it certainly is an everyday thing!', '2004-08-02 14:50:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(837312, 93571, 24939, '<td valign="top">The diagonal composition is good but I think the main problem is the lighting with half of the image in shadow. You needed to either have it all in shade or all in light for it to work better. The background adds some interesting color and textures.</td>', 'The diagonal composition is good but I think the main problem is the lighting with half of the image in shadow. You needed to either have it all in shade or all in light for it to work better. The background adds some interesting color and textures.', '2004-08-02 14:51:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(837318, 93305, 24939, '<td valign="top">I really like the lighting you used and the tone is interesting too. I like the placement of the dial and the negative spaced used. Only bad thing is the light blob reflection.</td>', 'I really like the lighting you used and the tone is interesting too. I like the placement of the dial and the negative spaced used. Only bad thing is the light blob reflection.', '2004-08-02 14:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(837319, 93982, 24939, '<td valign="top">Very neat closeup. Love the repeated pattern and the diagonal direction on the pencils. The background is cool too and matches the color of the pencils - a very warm tone. Really sharp too!</td>', 'Very neat closeup. Love the repeated pattern and the diagonal direction on the pencils. The background is cool too and matches the color of the pencils - a very warm tone. Really sharp too!', '2004-08-02 14:54:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(837322, 93270, 24939, '<td valign="top">Looks like some jaggies on my monitor in the background. Love the use of DOF and the repeated pattern.</td>', 'Looks like some jaggies on my monitor in the background. Love the use of DOF and the repeated pattern.', '2004-08-02 14:55:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(837324, 93423, 24939, '<td valign="top">Great toning and perspective. Has a cool mood to it.</td>', 'Great toning and perspective. Has a cool mood to it.', '2004-08-02 14:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(837329, 93926, 24939, '<td valign="top">I like the mix of colors and the negative space. Horizon looks a little tilted, tho.</td>', 'I like the mix of colors and the negative space. Horizon looks a little tilted, tho.', '2004-08-02 14:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(837330, 93631, 22659, '<td valign="top">I have the same flooring and the same wallet. Hey wait a minute! Is that mine? It  looks like mine. Oh, sorry, my mistake. I have Canadian money in my wallet.</td>', 'I have the same flooring and the same wallet. Hey wait a minute! Is that mine? It  looks like mine. Oh, sorry, my mistake. I have Canadian money in my wallet.', '2004-08-02 14:57:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(837331, 93960, 24939, '<td valign="top">This looks very classy in black and white and I like the texture of the wall too. Looks like a sweet ride.</td>', 'This looks very classy in black and white and I like the texture of the wall too. Looks like a sweet ride.', '2004-08-02 14:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(837335, 92966, 24939, '<td valign="top">Really like the sharpness of the image and great detail. I like the toning too. Maybe some more black space on the right.</td>', 'Really like the sharpness of the image and great detail. I like the toning too. Maybe some more black space on the right.', '2004-08-02 14:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(837339, 93903, 24939, '<td valign="top">I love it! Cool perspective and I really like the toning you''ve given it. The DOF makes it look like an optical illusion. Such a simple thing but looks really neat.</td>', 'I love it! Cool perspective and I really like the toning you''ve given it. The DOF makes it look like an optical illusion. Such a simple thing but looks really neat.', '2004-08-02 15:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(837342, 93923, 24939, '<td valign="top">Dont think much of the spotty background but Green Lanterns are cool!</td>', 'Dont think much of the spotty background but Green Lanterns are cool!', '2004-08-02 15:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(837346, 93216, 24939, '<td valign="top">Great use of negative space. Really cool and original shot.</td>', 'Great use of negative space. Really cool and original shot.', '2004-08-02 15:04:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(837349, 93641, 22659, '<td valign="top">Isn''t that nail hardener? lol Didn''t you think anyone would notice?  Just teasin'' ya.  Hmmm... about your picture. It seems that the blue bag is more in focus than the "nailpolish" or was that intentional? I kind of did the same thing for my Macro entry. Nice picture but no WOW factor. 6</td>', 'Isn''t that nail hardener? lol Didn''t you think anyone would notice?  Just teasin'' ya.  Hmmm... about your picture. It seems that the blue bag is more in focus than the "nailpolish" or was that intentional? I kind of did the same thing for my Macro entry. Nice picture but no WOW factor. 6', '2004-08-02 15:05:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(837352, 92990, 24939, '<td valign="top">Looks kinda blurry with not so good lighting. It has some purple fringing too. Should use a tripod in low light, play around with directional lighting using a torch or lamps if you dont have proper lighting stuff, and dont use a shallow dof as much.</td>', 'Looks kinda blurry with not so good lighting. It has some purple fringing too. Should use a tripod in low light, play around with directional lighting using a torch or lamps if you dont have proper lighting stuff, and dont use a shallow dof as much.', '2004-08-02 15:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(837353, 93097, 24939, '<td valign="top">Cool tones and textures.</td>', 'Cool tones and textures.', '2004-08-02 15:06:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(837355, 93898, 24939, '<td valign="top">Neat repeated pattern. It looks very abstract. Not sure about the white dots in the lower left corner.</td>', 'Neat repeated pattern. It looks very abstract. Not sure about the white dots in the lower left corner.', '2004-08-02 15:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(837357, 94018, 24939, '<td valign="top">Awwww that''s really sad, I love emotional images like this. Very cool.</td>', 'Awwww that''s really sad, I love emotional images like this. Very cool.', '2004-08-02 15:08:25.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(837359, 93427, 24939, '<td valign="top">That''s gonna leave a mark! I like how the cluttered background adds to the shot, it really helps with the mood.</td>', 'That''s gonna leave a mark! I like how the cluttered background adds to the shot, it really helps with the mood.', '2004-08-02 15:09:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(837360, 94077, 24939, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and I like the warm tones. I could see this hanging in a kitchen.</td>', 'Great lighting and I like the warm tones. I could see this hanging in a kitchen.', '2004-08-02 15:10:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(837361, 92826, 22659, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shot and title is great for it. I like the way it kind of looks like a fish in the middle. I might have even titled this picture "fish" if it was my entry just to get people to look a little longer to figure it out.  Great job - 7</td>', 'Very interesting shot and title is great for it. I like the way it kind of looks like a fish in the middle. I might have even titled this picture "fish" if it was my entry just to get people to look a little longer to figure it out.  Great job - 7', '2004-08-02 15:10:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(837362, 93473, 24939, '<td valign="top">Nice repeated pattern and toning.</td>', 'Nice repeated pattern and toning.', '2004-08-02 15:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(837366, 93825, 24939, '<td valign="top">I like the gold chrome of the hipflask but the color of the liquid on that color background just looks really weak. The area behind the flask looks a little overexposed too and could have done with some more negative space.</td>', 'I like the gold chrome of the hipflask but the color of the liquid on that color background just looks really weak. The area behind the flask looks a little overexposed too and could have done with some more negative space.', '2004-08-02 15:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(837370, 92858, 24939, '<td valign="top">I like the social commentary this image provokes. Should be interesting to see if it was taken by a male or a female. I like it.</td>', 'I like the social commentary this image provokes. Should be interesting to see if it was taken by a male or a female. I like it.', '2004-08-02 15:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(837371, 93876, 22659, '<td valign="top">I wish my daily exercise was as easy as cleaning my teeth. lol  The reflexion sets it off great. Super job on this picture. - 7</td>', 'I wish my daily exercise was as easy as cleaning my teeth. lol  The reflexion sets it off great. Super job on this picture. - 7', '2004-08-02 15:12:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(837375, 93686, 24939, '<td valign="top">Looks underexposed maybe, I dunno, but it seems to be missing something.</td>', 'Looks underexposed maybe, I dunno, but it seems to be missing something.', '2004-08-02 15:13:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(837378, 93310, 24939, '<td valign="top">Wild imagination! Neat shadow too although looks a bit overexposed in places.</td>', 'Wild imagination! Neat shadow too although looks a bit overexposed in places.', '2004-08-02 15:14:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(837379, 93775, 24939, '<td valign="top">Now that''s a creative use of toilet paper! Very neat shot, love it!</td>', 'Now that''s a creative use of toilet paper! Very neat shot, love it!', '2004-08-02 15:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(837385, 93107, 24939, '<td valign="top">I like how the pegs glow with your excellent use of lighting. Love the dof and composition too. Fun!</td>', 'I like how the pegs glow with your excellent use of lighting. Love the dof and composition too. Fun!', '2004-08-02 15:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(837386, 93849, 24939, '<td valign="top">How totally surreal it''s like the face is missing! The dryer looks overexposed too.</td>', 'How totally surreal it''s like the face is missing! The dryer looks overexposed too.', '2004-08-02 15:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(837389, 92752, 24939, '<td valign="top">I like the toning and the mood is really neat.</td>', 'I like the toning and the mood is really neat.', '2004-08-02 15:17:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(837393, 93760, 24939, '<td valign="top">Looks a little dark to me.</td>', 'Looks a little dark to me.', '2004-08-02 15:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(837394, 94081, 22659, '<td valign="top">Cute picture. I could just see a big poster of this hanging on the wall of a big, fat, bearded, beer bellied, tattooed, multiple piercing having, biker dude. lol  - 8</td>', 'Cute picture. I could just see a big poster of this hanging on the wall of a big, fat, bearded, beer bellied, tattooed, multiple piercing having, biker dude. lol  - 8', '2004-08-02 15:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(837398, 93779, 24939, '<td valign="top">Wow, cool, love the drop of blood that really makes it a killer shot as compared to a totally mundane one. Makes up for the kinda dull lighting too.</td>', 'Wow, cool, love the drop of blood that really makes it a killer shot as compared to a totally mundane one. Makes up for the kinda dull lighting too.', '2004-08-02 15:19:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(837407, 93868, 24939, '<td valign="top">Neat lighting, really makes a difference.</td>', 'Neat lighting, really makes a difference.', '2004-08-02 15:22:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(837411, 93697, 24939, '<td valign="top">Took me a while to realise its a monopoly game. The background is a little busy but it''s ok.</td>', 'Took me a while to realise its a monopoly game. The background is a little busy but it''s ok.', '2004-08-02 15:23:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(837414, 93957, 22748, '<td valign="top">The DOF, focus, camera angle, and the tight crop really make this great.  8</td>', 'The DOF, focus, camera angle, and the tight crop really make this great.  8', '2004-08-02 15:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(837416, 93439, 22659, '<td valign="top">Can you tell me them all? I can only think of 3. lol  Wait, I think I just thought of another use.  You probably think I should clean the dust out of my eyes for only giving you a 6. Nice picture, but no WOW factor for me.</td>', 'Can you tell me them all? I can only think of 3. lol  Wait, I think I just thought of another use.  You probably think I should clean the dust out of my eyes for only giving you a 6. Nice picture, but no WOW factor for me.', '2004-08-02 15:27:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(837422, 93399, 22659, '<td valign="top">Definately an everyday object but not a very appealing picture to me. The table cloth seems to have better focus than the keys. 5</td>', 'Definately an everyday object but not a very appealing picture to me. The table cloth seems to have better focus than the keys. 5', '2004-08-02 15:35:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(837424, 93899, 22659, '<td valign="top">Nice picture. A good advertisement for skechers.</td>', 'Nice picture. A good advertisement for skechers.', '2004-08-02 15:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(837447, 93841, 22748, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but this picture is a bit low in contrast and yellowy. Perhaps adjusting the white balance and playing with curves in Photoshop would help.</td>', 'I like the idea, but this picture is a bit low in contrast and yellowy. Perhaps adjusting the white balance and playing with curves in Photoshop would help.', '2004-08-02 15:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(837460, 93983, 22659, '<td valign="top">Imo - I would have cropped this way tighter around the model. Nice light source.</td>', 'Imo - I would have cropped this way tighter around the model. Nice light source.', '2004-08-02 16:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(837466, 94105, 22748, '<td valign="top">LOL! This is very creative. What''s the word? Anthropomorphic, giving human traits to inanimate objects. Well done, nice focus, DOF, interesting lighting and camera angle.</td>', 'LOL! This is very creative. What''s the word? Anthropomorphic, giving human traits to inanimate objects. Well done, nice focus, DOF, interesting lighting and camera angle.', '2004-08-02 16:03:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(837470, 92885, 22659, '<td valign="top">Very unique idea. What is the everyday obect here?</td>', 'Very unique idea. What is the everyday obect here?', '2004-08-02 16:07:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(837472, 93473, 22659, '<td valign="top">Super picture. Black and white works well for this shot. Great depth of field. 8</td>', 'Super picture. Black and white works well for this shot. Great depth of field. 8', '2004-08-02 16:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(837478, 93105, 22748, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and composition, but the blurriness and grainyness combined really don''t do it for me. I think that soft focus alone, or some fine grain applied could be good but this just looks like it came from a camera phone or something.</td>', 'I like the idea and composition, but the blurriness and grainyness combined really don''t do it for me. I think that soft focus alone, or some fine grain applied could be good but this just looks like it came from a camera phone or something.', '2004-08-02 16:10:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(837482, 93626, 22748, '<td valign="top">Dude, you make me hungry. I thought I was safe now that the chocolate challenge was over! ;-) Low and interesting viewpoint, nicely organized cookies, sharp focus. A good picture.</td>', 'Dude, you make me hungry. I thought I was safe now that the chocolate challenge was over! ;-) Low and interesting viewpoint, nicely organized cookies, sharp focus. A good picture.', '2004-08-02 16:12:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(837485, 92967, 22659, '<td valign="top">Keys.</td>', 'Keys.', '2004-08-02 16:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(837503, 94044, 22748, '<td valign="top">Technically, well done. But uninteresting. It doesn''t catch my eye. Maybe if it wasn''t so centered. Try getting lower, right down on the table, and put the apple on one of the thirds points. (Read about the rule of thirds if you haven''t heard of it.)</td>', 'Technically, well done. But uninteresting. It doesn''t catch my eye. Maybe if it wasn''t so centered. Try getting lower, right down on the table, and put the apple on one of the thirds points. (Read about the rule of thirds if you haven''t heard of it.)', '2004-08-02 16:18:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(837523, 94021, 22659, '<td valign="top">Super shot! I can''t see how to improve this at all.  10</td>', 'Super shot! I can''t see how to improve this at all.  10', '2004-08-02 16:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(837555, 93337, 22659, '<td valign="top">I thought they didn''t make coloured TP anymore because people were suffering from adverse affects on the corn hole. Or was this done in Adobe?</td>', 'I thought they didn''t make coloured TP anymore because people were suffering from adverse affects on the corn hole. Or was this done in Adobe?', '2004-08-02 16:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(837663, 93790, 24889, '<td valign="top">Is this the edenproject?????</td>', 'Is this the edenproject?????', '2004-08-02 17:35:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(837784, 93869, 509, '<td valign="top">I like the treatment of this, in that it stands out from the typical flower shot.  If this was a member challenge, I''d suggest some dodging and burning to bring out the flowers and subdue the grass a bit.</td>', 'I like the treatment of this, in that it stands out from the typical flower shot.  If this was a member challenge, I''d suggest some dodging and burning to bring out the flowers and subdue the grass a bit.', '2004-08-02 18:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(837792, 93199, 509, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject, but might work better without the bottom two lines showing, and maybe with the green channel desaturated to just show the red, blue and yellow channels.</td>', 'Interesting subject, but might work better without the bottom two lines showing, and maybe with the green channel desaturated to just show the red, blue and yellow channels.', '2004-08-02 18:21:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(837796, 93887, 509, '<td valign="top">Nice low-key shot.  I like the framing, but would prefer to see more detail in the alarm clock.  An analogue clock (preferably with some green in it to parallel the lamp) might be a better choice.  Definitely "every day" objects.</td>', 'Nice low-key shot.  I like the framing, but would prefer to see more detail in the alarm clock.  An analogue clock (preferably with some green in it to parallel the lamp) might be a better choice.  Definitely "every day" objects.', '2004-08-02 18:23:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(837798, 93955, 509, '<td valign="top">Lighting is well done, as is the composition.  Should do well = )</td>', 'Lighting is well done, as is the composition.  Should do well = )', '2004-08-02 18:24:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(837805, 94090, 509, '<td valign="top">The focus is spot on, showing a lot of detail in this shot.  Interesting shot.</td>', 'The focus is spot on, showing a lot of detail in this shot.  Interesting shot.', '2004-08-02 18:25:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(837810, 94088, 509, '<td valign="top">While a lightbulb would be a great subject in this challenge, I don''t think it is presented as well as it could be here.  The clock really doesn''t belong in this composition imho - it detracts from the light bulb and with its coloring (vs the colors elsewhere in the shot), doesn''t show a lot of contrast.</td>', 'While a lightbulb would be a great subject in this challenge, I don''t think it is presented as well as it could be here.  The clock really doesn''t belong in this composition imho - it detracts from the light bulb and with its coloring (vs the colors elsewhere in the shot), doesn''t show a lot of contrast.', '2004-08-02 18:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(837824, 93053, 24024, '<td valign="top">Absolutely gorgeous abstract. The border really adds to it too! MY top pick. Good luck!</td>', 'Absolutely gorgeous abstract. The border really adds to it too! MY top pick. Good luck!', '2004-08-02 18:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(837825, 94007, 22134, '<td valign="top">simply beautiful.</td>', 'simply beautiful.', '2004-08-02 18:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(837835, 93438, 509, '<td valign="top">Photographically, this shot doesn''t hold very much interest.  Black and white is probably the best treatment for this, but I would suggest a different composition.  If the house in the bottom left is to be included, it might be better if it was completely visible.  Also, the angles created by the house and telephone pole do not work well with the vertical post, and are a bit blurry as well.  I''d suggest shooting this from an angle a little further left to crop out the house and pole, and the use of fill flash or positive exposure compensation to brighten up the sign a bit.</td>', 'Photographically, this shot doesn''t hold very much interest.  Black and white is probably the best treatment for this, but I would suggest a different composition.  If the house in the bottom left is to be included, it might be better if it was completely visible.  Also, the angles created by the house and telephone pole do not work well with the vertical post, and are a bit blurry as well.  I''d suggest shooting this from an angle a little further left to crop out the house and pole, and the use of fill flash or positive exposure compensation to brighten up the sign a bit.', '2004-08-02 18:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(837840, 93640, 509, '<td valign="top">I like the angle created by the zipper and the mood set here.  I think this would look better as a black and white shot though, rather than the blue/black/white.  Reason being, the colors don''t contribute to the intimate nature of this shot.  A great idea though.</td>', 'I like the angle created by the zipper and the mood set here.  I think this would look better as a black and white shot though, rather than the blue/black/white.  Reason being, the colors don''t contribute to the intimate nature of this shot.  A great idea though.', '2004-08-02 18:41:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(837842, 93957, 509, '<td valign="top">Shallow depth of field is useful in many shots, but I''m not sure I understand its use here.  I got nailed for a similar thing a few challenges back - the more detailed areas (the "shirt") are out of focus, while there isn''t a lot to see on the head.  For this shot, I''d actually prefer the entire legoman in focus.  Other than that, the exposure is nicely done.  I''d also like to see the shadows on the bottom accentuated, given the overhead viewpoint - this might be done with some stronger back lighting.</td>', 'Shallow depth of field is useful in many shots, but I''m not sure I understand its use here.  I got nailed for a similar thing a few challenges back - the more detailed areas (the "shirt") are out of focus, while there isn''t a lot to see on the head.  For this shot, I''d actually prefer the entire legoman in focus.  Other than that, the exposure is nicely done.  I''d also like to see the shadows on the bottom accentuated, given the overhead viewpoint - this might be done with some stronger back lighting.', '2004-08-02 18:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(837863, 94093, 509, '<td valign="top">The focus and white balance seem a little off, but I like the idea and the lighting / shadows.</td>', 'The focus and white balance seem a little off, but I like the idea and the lighting / shadows.', '2004-08-02 18:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(837867, 93749, 23203, '<td valign="top">Nice!<br/> <br/>This is one of my top three picks for the challenge.</td>', 'Nice! This is one of my top three picks for the challenge.', '2004-08-02 19:00:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(837868, 94117, 23203, '<td valign="top">Wow! Nice shot. Good lighting.<br/> <br/>This is one of my top three picks for the challenge.</td>', 'Wow! Nice shot. Good lighting. This is one of my top three picks for the challenge.', '2004-08-02 19:00:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(837869, 94007, 23203, '<td valign="top">Wow! How did you remove the camera from this shot?<br/> <br/>This is one of my top three picks for the challenge.</td>', 'Wow! How did you remove the camera from this shot? This is one of my top three picks for the challenge.', '2004-08-02 19:01:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(837876, 93933, 23203, '<td valign="top">Really Nice. The lighting could probably have been a little tilted to avoid the reflection. 9<br/> <br/></td>', 'Really Nice. The lighting could probably have been a little tilted to avoid the reflection. 9 ', '2004-08-02 19:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(837878, 93312, 23203, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. 9</td>', 'Nice composition. 9', '2004-08-02 19:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(837881, 94010, 23203, '<td valign="top">Really Nice! 9.</td>', 'Really Nice! 9.', '2004-08-02 19:04:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(837925, 93316, 24024, '<td valign="top">I like the arrangement of the knife and fork, it looks very much like someone just finished eating. However, the dirtyness of the plate is very unappealing. Also, the salt and pepper shakers, being taller that the rest of the scene, are out of focus, and a bit distracting.  Also their placement is ackward in the frame.</td>', 'I like the arrangement of the knife and fork, it looks very much like someone just finished eating. However, the dirtyness of the plate is very unappealing. Also, the salt and pepper shakers, being taller that the rest of the scene, are out of focus, and a bit distracting.  Also their placement is ackward in the frame.', '2004-08-02 19:39:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(837926, 93483, 24024, '<td valign="top">The heavy shadows take away from the focus on the main subject.</td>', 'The heavy shadows take away from the focus on the main subject.', '2004-08-02 19:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(837933, 94097, 24024, '<td valign="top">I like the way you framed the cup, and also how the frame matches the colors in the photo, it is a nice touch. However,  the silk rose is a bit out of place, also the lighting is a bit harsh.</td>', 'I like the way you framed the cup, and also how the frame matches the colors in the photo, it is a nice touch. However,  the silk rose is a bit out of place, also the lighting is a bit harsh.', '2004-08-02 19:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(837937, 94106, 24024, '<td valign="top">Funny, but not very appealing photo, his expression on his face is a bit repulsive.  :)</td>', 'Funny, but not very appealing photo, his expression on his face is a bit repulsive.  :)', '2004-08-02 19:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(837940, 94046, 24024, '<td valign="top">Hmmm... Not everyday....</td>', 'Hmmm... Not everyday....', '2004-08-02 19:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(837961, 94079, 24024, '<td valign="top">A  little tippy-- feels almost more like a roller coaster than a train car! :)</td>', 'A  little tippy-- feels almost more like a roller coaster than a train car! :)', '2004-08-02 19:57:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(837968, 93660, 24024, '<td valign="top">This is a nice action shot, but bike races aren''t all that common. If it was the bike that you were thinking was an everyday object, it might have been better to take a picture of it in a more common setting. But as it is, it doens''t seem too everyday.</td>', 'This is a nice action shot, but bike races aren''t all that common. If it was the bike that you were thinking was an everyday object, it might have been better to take a picture of it in a more common setting. But as it is, it doens''t seem too everyday.', '2004-08-02 20:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(837974, 93511, 24024, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, good light on the face, there''s  a bit of a reflection off the wall, which takes away from the soft look of the photo. As it stands, however, I don''t think it is a very "everyday object".... Hmmmm unless.... are you saying that fantasies are an everyday object??? If i read it like that it fits the challenge! I''m going to change my vote now... Hopefully that is what you meant!</td>', 'Nice photo, good light on the face, there''s  a bit of a reflection off the wall, which takes away from the soft look of the photo. As it stands, however, I don''t think it is a very "everyday object".... Hmmmm unless.... are you saying that fantasies are an everyday object??? If i read it like that it fits the challenge! I''m going to change my vote now... Hopefully that is what you meant!', '2004-08-02 20:05:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(837992, 94050, 24024, '<td valign="top">The tree behind the statue has a funny green hue. It looks a bit unnatural. This scene doesn''t invoke a feeling of "every day object" for me. Is it the coins? If so, perhaps shooting pictures of the coins in a different context would be better.</td>', 'The tree behind the statue has a funny green hue. It looks a bit unnatural. This scene doesn''t invoke a feeling of "every day object" for me. Is it the coins? If so, perhaps shooting pictures of the coins in a different context would be better.', '2004-08-02 20:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
