(838000, 92912, 24024, '<td valign="top">Very tripy. I''m not sure what is going on with the special effects. The poinsetta in the background is distracting from the subject flowers.</td>', 'Very tripy. I''m not sure what is going on with the special effects. The poinsetta in the background is distracting from the subject flowers.', '2004-08-02 20:17:01.000000', NULL, 1),
