(838693, 92721, 19831, '<td valign="top">I think I see what you were going for, but maybe if you got the mug out on a branch silhouetted against the sky by itself, you could tell what it is better, and would have more impact. Also, changing the angle could get rid of the green tree in the corner. Just the vine and mug and sky I think would be much stronger.</td>', 'I think I see what you were going for, but maybe if you got the mug out on a branch silhouetted against the sky by itself, you could tell what it is better, and would have more impact. Also, changing the angle could get rid of the green tree in the corner. Just the vine and mug and sky I think would be much stronger.', '2004-08-03 04:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(838695, 93767, 24824, '<td valign="top">Oh, nice shot!  I would have liked to have seen this in a sepia tone, but I still love it.</td>', 'Oh, nice shot!  I would have liked to have seen this in a sepia tone, but I still love it.', '2004-08-03 04:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
