(838700, 93398, 19831, '<td valign="top">If you purposely used a scuffed ball to show use, I can see that, but I think a new ball would look better in the shot and still convey the same meaning.</td>', 'If you purposely used a scuffed ball to show use, I can see that, but I think a new ball would look better in the shot and still convey the same meaning.', '2004-08-03 04:18:38.000000', NULL, 1),
