(838705, 94007, 12802, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot, good clear DOF, like the clarity of the whole shot. Full marks! <br/> <br/>Think you''ve probably got a few folk fooled (including me) but where''s your camera??  I think the angle of the water looks a little funny, i.e. if the call is at the waters edge, how can the reflection be like it is... Questions, Questions, Questions.... what all good shots should produce!! :-)</td>', 'This is a great shot, good clear DOF, like the clarity of the whole shot. Full marks!  Think you''ve probably got a few folk fooled (including me) but where''s your camera??  I think the angle of the water looks a little funny, i.e. if the call is at the waters edge, how can the reflection be like it is... Questions, Questions, Questions.... what all good shots should produce!! :-)', '2004-08-03 04:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(838707, 93983, 19831, '<td valign="top">I think this has some potential to be great. I think whatever the lights are at the top of the photo don''t help at all. There is a great mood going, but then the model looking at the camera and smiling spoils it. They should be looking down at the candles and looking serious.</td>', 'I think this has some potential to be great. I think whatever the lights are at the top of the photo don''t help at all. There is a great mood going, but then the model looking at the camera and smiling spoils it. They should be looking down at the candles and looking serious.', '2004-08-03 04:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(838708, 94113, 19831, '<td valign="top">I think this is the best of all the remote photos entered. I like how you''ve included the screen in the background.</td>', 'I think this is the best of all the remote photos entered. I like how you''ve included the screen in the background.', '2004-08-03 04:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
