(838714, 93080, 12802, '<td valign="top">Nice colours here, the greens stand out well.  Kind of spooky shot with the web so large.  Maybe a little out of focus, I can see there''s a good DOF here, but the middle that''s supposed to be in focus is just a little out. <br/> <br/>I think if your title had been something like ''The World Wide Web'' this may have prompted me to give you a few extra marks.  No matter what folk say, a carefully chosen title definately helps! 7</td>', 'Nice colours here, the greens stand out well.  Kind of spooky shot with the web so large.  Maybe a little out of focus, I can see there''s a good DOF here, but the middle that''s supposed to be in focus is just a little out.  I think if your title had been something like ''The World Wide Web'' this may have prompted me to give you a few extra marks.  No matter what folk say, a carefully chosen title definately helps! 7', '2004-08-03 04:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
