(840440, 93973, 22975, '<td valign="top">i''m not sure what i like more, the shoes or the photo... they''re both very cool.  8</td>', 'i''m not sure what i like more, the shoes or the photo... they''re both very cool.  8', '2004-08-03 22:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(840441, 92895, 12825, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but I don''t think it meets the challenge.</td>', 'Nice shot but I don''t think it meets the challenge.', '2004-08-03 22:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(840443, 93310, 22975, '<td valign="top">this does have a "psycho" feel to it.  very humorous composition, i really like it.</td>', 'this does have a "psycho" feel to it.  very humorous composition, i really like it.', '2004-08-03 22:10:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(840444, 94016, 9668, '<td valign="top">A good composition of a shabby spoon. Interesting coloration.</td>', 'A good composition of a shabby spoon. Interesting coloration.', '2004-08-03 22:10:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(840445, 93779, 12825, '<td valign="top">Great idea!</td>', 'Great idea!', '2004-08-03 22:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(840446, 93319, 22975, '<td valign="top">fabulous lighting... almost makes me want a glass of boring old bottled water.</td>', 'fabulous lighting... almost makes me want a glass of boring old bottled water.', '2004-08-03 22:11:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(840447, 92770, 22975, '<td valign="top">everytime i look at this, i have to re-focus to figure out exactly what i''m looking at.  i really like images that challenge my eyes.  8</td>', 'everytime i look at this, i have to re-focus to figure out exactly what i''m looking at.  i really like images that challenge my eyes.  8', '2004-08-03 22:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(840448, 93749, 22975, '<td valign="top">the soft lighting really makes this photo... it''s so relaxing to me.  makes me feel like i don''t have a care in the world... :)  8</td>', 'the soft lighting really makes this photo... it''s so relaxing to me.  makes me feel like i don''t have a care in the world... :)  8', '2004-08-03 22:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(840450, 92721, 12825, '<td valign="top">Not enough contrast between the mug and the tree.  Not sure if it was possible but I think doing your light meter on the tree or mug would have led to a more balanced exposure.</td>', 'Not enough contrast between the mug and the tree.  Not sure if it was possible but I think doing your light meter on the tree or mug would have led to a more balanced exposure.', '2004-08-03 22:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(840457, 93633, 9668, '<td valign="top">This should do well. Edges seema bit over sharpened, nice border, I like the midair look.</td>', 'This should do well. Edges seema bit over sharpened, nice border, I like the midair look.', '2004-08-03 22:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(840458, 93771, 22975, '<td valign="top">this just cracks me up!!</td>', 'this just cracks me up!!', '2004-08-03 22:20:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(840459, 93687, 9668, '<td valign="top">This image size could be doubled, which would give you a higher quality. I like the setup, the look inside a photographer.</td>', 'This image size could be doubled, which would give you a higher quality. I like the setup, the look inside a photographer.', '2004-08-03 22:22:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(840460, 93882, 19978, '<td valign="top">Great action shot!</td>', 'Great action shot!', '2004-08-03 22:23:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(840461, 93749, 19978, '<td valign="top">Very nice compositional idea and decent execution. I would have liked to have seen a bit more contrast between the paper and the background, but I''m not sure how I would have gone about it. Very well done.</td>', 'Very nice compositional idea and decent execution. I would have liked to have seen a bit more contrast between the paper and the background, but I''m not sure how I would have gone about it. Very well done.', '2004-08-03 22:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(840464, 92979, 12253, '<td valign="top">Very clever and generally well done, though it would be nice to have caught the flame centered and obsure the candle just a bit more -- it''s peeking out of the right side.</td>', 'Very clever and generally well done, though it would be nice to have caught the flame centered and obsure the candle just a bit more -- it''s peeking out of the right side.', '2004-08-03 22:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(840474, 93846, 10818, '<td valign="top">I am not sure how everyday it is..at least for me.   I have never used one, nor eaten from one....that being said....its a great shot, I love the colors and the intensity of the flames...great shot</td>', 'I am not sure how everyday it is..at least for me.   I have never used one, nor eaten from one....that being said....its a great shot, I love the colors and the intensity of the flames...great shot', '2004-08-03 22:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(840479, 93859, 14476, '<td valign="top">Just want you to know this image shows good seeing and excellent composition, and I hope you are doing well with it.</td>', 'Just want you to know this image shows good seeing and excellent composition, and I hope you are doing well with it.', '2004-08-03 22:47:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(840482, 93624, 14476, '<td valign="top">Just making one last pass through the Challenge, and want to say this is a great entry.  Good composition;  the color fits the image perfectly - good one.</td>', 'Just making one last pass through the Challenge, and want to say this is a great entry.  Good composition;  the color fits the image perfectly - good one.', '2004-08-03 22:49:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(840486, 94058, 14476, '<td valign="top">The cute wallpaper raised this image to above average.   Otherwise, it is cropped a tad close in spots.  Nevertheless, it''s a fun photo.</td>', 'The cute wallpaper raised this image to above average.   Otherwise, it is cropped a tad close in spots.  Nevertheless, it''s a fun photo.', '2004-08-03 22:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(840490, 94015, 14476, '<td valign="top">I hope that was a CRT and not a LCD you whacked that thing onto.  It was a cute idea and original, and that raised it above average.  Expect you had fun doing this one.</td>', 'I hope that was a CRT and not a LCD you whacked that thing onto.  It was a cute idea and original, and that raised it above average.  Expect you had fun doing this one.', '2004-08-03 22:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(840496, 94083, 10818, '<td valign="top">Wow, that is so cool....kinda makes me miss my college days while experimenting with  "stuff".  Very original...(to say the least  :)  photo !  10</td>', 'Wow, that is so cool....kinda makes me miss my college days while experimenting with  "stuff".  Very original...(to say the least  :)  photo !  10', '2004-08-03 22:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(840499, 93427, 19978, '<td valign="top">Exceptional composition and very nicely set up. I''m anxious to see how you did it. One of my favorites for the challenge.</td>', 'Exceptional composition and very nicely set up. I''m anxious to see how you did it. One of my favorites for the challenge.', '2004-08-03 22:59:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(840508, 93926, 22011, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo...  The only detraction is the horizon being on a lean..  Really simple composition that works soo well.</td>', 'This is a great photo...  The only detraction is the horizon being on a lean..  Really simple composition that works soo well.', '2004-08-03 23:05:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(840525, 94018, 7628, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of the Velveteen Rabbit.  I like the subtle duotone - just the color of a faded teddy bear.  Nice dark shadows in the grass and good grass texture - both work as a good back drop to the bear.  I especiallly like the wistful expression on the bear''s face. 9</td>', 'Reminds me of the Velveteen Rabbit.  I like the subtle duotone - just the color of a faded teddy bear.  Nice dark shadows in the grass and good grass texture - both work as a good back drop to the bear.  I especiallly like the wistful expression on the bear''s face. 9', '2004-08-03 23:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(840527, 93906, 22123, '<td valign="top">I like this photo---its funny!</td>', 'I like this photo---its funny!', '2004-08-03 23:17:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(840531, 93188, 22123, '<td valign="top">good use of macro, and interesting detail.</td>', 'good use of macro, and interesting detail.', '2004-08-03 23:19:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(840532, 93882, 7628, '<td valign="top">A marvelous doggie photo.  Good fast shutter speed - I like the stopped water.  The colors are very true.  The expression on the dogs face is prefect glee!  I like the way the gray water frames the top and bottom and we can just see a suggestion of the reflection. 8</td>', 'A marvelous doggie photo.  Good fast shutter speed - I like the stopped water.  The colors are very true.  The expression on the dogs face is prefect glee!  I like the way the gray water frames the top and bottom and we can just see a suggestion of the reflection. 8', '2004-08-03 23:19:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(840537, 93749, 7628, '<td valign="top">This is such a simple image, but I can only imagine how difficult it was to get the lighting right to acheive these abstract forms.  Truely an everyday object seen in a new light! A favorite of mine for the challenge.9</td>', 'This is such a simple image, but I can only imagine how difficult it was to get the lighting right to acheive these abstract forms.  Truely an everyday object seen in a new light! A favorite of mine for the challenge.9', '2004-08-03 23:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(840541, 94007, 22659, '<td valign="top">Awsome idea! I may just have to "borrow" this idea from you some day. lol  Wonderfully shot. I''d give you more than a 10 if I could.</td>', 'Awsome idea! I may just have to "borrow" this idea from you some day. lol  Wonderfully shot. I''d give you more than a 10 if I could.', '2004-08-03 23:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(840542, 94105, 22123, '<td valign="top">hahah that''s funny! i like it.</td>', 'hahah that''s funny! i like it.', '2004-08-03 23:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(840544, 93100, 22123, '<td valign="top">cool use of perspective and macro!</td>', 'cool use of perspective and macro!', '2004-08-03 23:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(840547, 93685, 22123, '<td valign="top">good lighting.</td>', 'good lighting.', '2004-08-03 23:25:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(840550, 94095, 22123, '<td valign="top">good. i like the bubble. it makes the photo more intersting.</td>', 'good. i like the bubble. it makes the photo more intersting.', '2004-08-03 23:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(840553, 94007, 7628, '<td valign="top">Fabulous!  All technical aspects are well done, and artistically it is entrancing.  Especially nice touch having the footprints.  Want to know what you did with the camera...</td>', 'Fabulous!  All technical aspects are well done, and artistically it is entrancing.  Especially nice touch having the footprints.  Want to know what you did with the camera...', '2004-08-03 23:29:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(840557, 93860, 23755, '<td valign="top">Original to say the least</td>', 'Original to say the least', '2004-08-03 23:30:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(840558, 93812, 23755, '<td valign="top">Nice use of color</td>', 'Nice use of color', '2004-08-03 23:31:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(840560, 93651, 23755, '<td valign="top">Like the dof</td>', 'Like the dof', '2004-08-03 23:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(840561, 93398, 23755, '<td valign="top">Like the use of light</td>', 'Like the use of light', '2004-08-03 23:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(840562, 94010, 23755, '<td valign="top">Spectacular</td>', 'Spectacular', '2004-08-03 23:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(840564, 93749, 10818, '<td valign="top">So simple but so very effective.  The colors and the sotness are just perfect....wonderful photo.</td>', 'So simple but so very effective.  The colors and the sotness are just perfect....wonderful photo.', '2004-08-03 23:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(840566, 93111, 22659, '<td valign="top">Very good shot of a pretty flower. 8</td>', 'Very good shot of a pretty flower. 8', '2004-08-03 23:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(840568, 93400, 22659, '<td valign="top">Beautiful masonry work. They don''t put workmanship like that into buidings anymore. I should know being a mason.</td>', 'Beautiful masonry work. They don''t put workmanship like that into buidings anymore. I should know being a mason.', '2004-08-03 23:37:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(840570, 93920, 22659, '<td valign="top">Very nice. It looks like some effort went into arranging the pencils just right. 8</td>', 'Very nice. It looks like some effort went into arranging the pencils just right. 8', '2004-08-03 23:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(840578, 93749, 12160, '<td valign="top">Creative. Realy nice muted color helps to soften the whole image... almost like a flower. Very well done.</td>', 'Creative. Realy nice muted color helps to soften the whole image... almost like a flower. Very well done.', '2004-08-03 23:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(840580, 93008, 22659, '<td valign="top">Nice toes :) I give you 1 point for each of them. 10</td>', 'Nice toes :) I give you 1 point for each of them. 10', '2004-08-03 23:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(840583, 93779, 22659, '<td valign="top">And all this time I thought meat was food. My bad. 7</td>', 'And all this time I thought meat was food. My bad. 7', '2004-08-03 23:46:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(840587, 93938, 22659, '<td valign="top">YOUR GOING THE WRONG WAYYYYY!.....</td>', 'YOUR GOING THE WRONG WAYYYYY!.....', '2004-08-03 23:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(840590, 92810, 24024, '<td valign="top">I like the subtle perspective of the table.</td>', 'I like the subtle perspective of the table.', '2004-08-03 23:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
