(841027, 94106, 22385, '<td valign="top">I personally don''t think this photo warranted 1 or 2 ratings. I actually voted this a 7. The photo is really funny, is in sharp focus, and great composition. The humor alone makes this photo a memorable one.</td>', 'I personally don''t think this photo warranted 1 or 2 ratings. I actually voted this a 7. The photo is really funny, is in sharp focus, and great composition. The humor alone makes this photo a memorable one.', '2004-08-04 02:04:59.000000', NULL, 0),
