(841087, 93682, 2612, '<td valign="top">Even without WOW factor, I think this rated higher than 5.654. The exposure and focus were both carfully controlled to meet your objective and the composition was at least thoughtful. I''m not sure how that results in so many 5s on a scale of 1 to 10. Would have been a 7 from me, but evidently I didn''t vote on enough to reach this one (sorry).</td>', 'Even without WOW factor, I think this rated higher than 5.654. The exposure and focus were both carfully controlled to meet your objective and the composition was at least thoughtful. I''m not sure how that results in so many 5s on a scale of 1 to 10. Would have been a 7 from me, but evidently I didn''t vote on enough to reach this one (sorry).', '2004-08-04 02:21:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(841091, 93973, 714, '<td valign="top">It just doesn''t seem to have enough contrast and good focus.  It wouldn''t have been to bad if more of the shoes were in focus and maybe more light.  Try it again or even go back into psp and see what you can do to it.</td>', 'It just doesn''t seem to have enough contrast and good focus.  It wouldn''t have been to bad if more of the shoes were in focus and maybe more light.  Try it again or even go back into psp and see what you can do to it.', '2004-08-04 02:23:10.000000', NULL, 0),
