(841266, 93857, 11078, '<td valign="top">Hi Lee from the Critique Club<br/> <br/>This is a very good composition and a great idea<br/>I like the silhouette look but to me the white is a bit stark  <br/>I agree with the voter who says the straw should face inwards <br/>I like the hand <br/>Very good detail and focus <br/>You score is good but I guess you would have liked better (wouldnt we all) I cannot be much help as to why it didn''t score higher <br/>There were a lot of great images in this challenge yours being one of them but there can only be 3 ribbon holders At least 3 people so far have added it to there Favorite list <br/>Continue to enjoy your photography <br/>and Good luck for future Challenge entries If you have any questions please feel free to PM me <br/>Regards<br/>Sally</td>', 'Hi Lee from the Critique Club This is a very good composition and a great ideaI like the silhouette look but to me the white is a bit stark  I agree with the voter who says the straw should face inwards I like the hand Very good detail and focus You score is good but I guess you would have liked better (wouldnt we all) I cannot be much help as to why it didn''t score higher There were a lot of great images in this challenge yours being one of them but there can only be 3 ribbon holders At least 3 people so far have added it to there Favorite list Continue to enjoy your photography and Good luck for future Challenge entries If you have any questions please feel free to PM me RegardsSally', '2004-08-04 03:28:03.000000', NULL, 0),
