(841332, 93456, 11078, '<td valign="top">Hello Melissa from the Critique Club<br/> <br/>It seem you have got me twice tonight I hope that you won''t mind too much <br/> <br/>This is a good choice for Everyday Objects <br/>But the background looks very white which in turn gives a very sort of one dimentional look to the shoe  <br/>This may have been better to tone down the shoe and place it on a dark blue background or even with some Denim Jeans <br/>IMHO this is a good idea but for some reason just doesn''t really work<br/>(I have plenty of those moments) LOL! I also find the D P C voters are not all that great on Digital manipulation for some reason <br/>Sorry I cannot be a lot of help but enjoy your photography and good luck in your future Challenges <br/>Regards<br/>Sally</td>', 'Hello Melissa from the Critique Club It seem you have got me twice tonight I hope that you won''t mind too much  This is a good choice for Everyday Objects But the background looks very white which in turn gives a very sort of one dimentional look to the shoe  This may have been better to tone down the shoe and place it on a dark blue background or even with some Denim Jeans IMHO this is a good idea but for some reason just doesn''t really work(I have plenty of those moments) LOL! I also find the D P C voters are not all that great on Digital manipulation for some reason Sorry I cannot be a lot of help but enjoy your photography and good luck in your future Challenges RegardsSally', '2004-08-04 03:58:39.000000', NULL, 0),
