(841471, 93983, 8522, '<td valign="top">I really liked this photo... but I guess because the model is smiling, it may look too much like a snapshot for most people. I purposely used a lot of negative space as I wanted the table and model to ''float'' within the frame. I personally like the lights at the top, but can see that it may not be to everybody''s taste.</td>', 'I really liked this photo... but I guess because the model is smiling, it may look too much like a snapshot for most people. I purposely used a lot of negative space as I wanted the table and model to ''float'' within the frame. I personally like the lights at the top, but can see that it may not be to everybody''s taste.', '2004-08-04 06:58:48.000000', NULL, 0),
