(852794, 92744, 772, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club...<br/> <br/>Hi Dyri...<br/> <br/>This is a challenging photo to ''critique''.  I can certainly see how it meets the challenge for you.  It''s probalby a road sign that you pass every day... something simple... something without frills.  <br/> <br/>The image doesn''t hold any special interest for me as a viewer.  I can''t look at this and be inspired by the composition, photographic technique, or the subject.  Even though it meets the challenge, there needs to be something photographically interesting about the image as well for higher placements most likely.<br/> <br/>Cheers and good luck in the future :)<br/> <br/>John Setzler<br/></td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club... Hi Dyri... This is a challenging photo to ''critique''.  I can certainly see how it meets the challenge for you.  It''s probalby a road sign that you pass every day... something simple... something without frills.   The image doesn''t hold any special interest for me as a viewer.  I can''t look at this and be inspired by the composition, photographic technique, or the subject.  Even though it meets the challenge, there needs to be something photographically interesting about the image as well for higher placements most likely. Cheers and good luck in the future :) John Setzler', '2004-08-10 17:10:21.000000', NULL, 0),
