(1992619, 93957, 34659, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe this scored a 4.5 either...  The trolls must have been out in force for that one!  LOL  This is a very strong photo IMHO.  It''s got great composition, controlled lighting, good focus &amp; DOF, etc...  I agree with glad2badad - Smile &amp; keep having fun!  ''Cuz you''ve got a great eye!</td>', 'I can''t believe this scored a 4.5 either...  The trolls must have been out in force for that one!  LOL  This is a very strong photo IMHO.  It''s got great composition, controlled lighting, good focus & DOF, etc...  I agree with glad2badad - Smile & keep having fun!  ''Cuz you''ve got a great eye!', '2006-01-01 15:24:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(2015487, 93859, 43088, '<td valign="top">That looks familiar! (latest Shapes II challenge- you linked in your comment). I used a little more contrast and also some perspective correction (not sure if that is allowed in basic editing, but I didn''t use it that much). It is a very graphic building.  I have seen pictures on DP of several places I recognize. San Diego is a great place for photographs. So far they are rating it about the same- at about 5.9 now. Nice job on yours too!</td>', 'That looks familiar! (latest Shapes II challenge- you linked in your comment). I used a little more contrast and also some perspective correction (not sure if that is allowed in basic editing, but I didn''t use it that much). It is a very graphic building.  I have seen pictures on DP of several places I recognize. San Diego is a great place for photographs. So far they are rating it about the same- at about 5.9 now. Nice job on yours too!', '2006-01-08 17:35:09.000000', NULL, 0),
